msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.title"
msgstr "Guuleystayaasha abaalmarinta $10,000 ee muuqaalka ISBN"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.tldr"
msgstr "TL;DR: Waxaan helnay soo gudbinta cajiib ah oo loogu talagalay abaalmarinta $10,000 ee muuqaalka ISBN."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.text1"
msgstr "Dhowr bilood ka hor waxaan ku dhawaaqnay <a %(all_isbns)s>abaalmarinta $10,000</a> si loo sameeyo muuqaalka ugu wanaagsan ee suurtogalka ah ee xogtayada muujinaysa booska ISBN. Waxaan diiradda saarnay muujinta faylasha aan horey u keydinay/aanan keydin, waxaana markii dambe soo bandhignay xog ururin sharaxaysa inta maktabadood ee haysta ISBN-yada (qiyaasta naadirnimada)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.text2"
msgstr "Waxaan la kulannay jawaab aad u weyn. Waxaa jiray hal-abuur aad u badan. Mahad weyn oo gaar ah dhammaan kuwa ka qayb qaatay: tamartaada iyo xamaasaddaada waa la qaadi karaa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.text3"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii waxaan rabnay inaan ka jawaabno su'aalaha soo socda: <strong>buugaagtee ayaa ka jira adduunka, imisa ayaan horey u kaydinay, iyo buugaagtee ayaan diiradda saari karnaa xiga?</strong> Waa wax weyn in la arko dad badan oo daneynaya su'aalahan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.text4"
msgstr "Waxaan ku bilownay sawir fudud annaga qudheena. In ka yar 300kb, sawirkan wuxuu si kooban u matalayaa \"liiska buugaagta\" ugu weyn ee si buuxda u furan oo abid la soo ururiyey taariikhda aadanaha:"

