#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text6"
msgstr "Waxaan soo saarnay caqabado lagu horumarinayo tan. Waxaan ku abaalmarin lahayn abaalmarinta koowaad $6,000, kaalinta labaad $3,000, iyo kaalinta saddexaad $1,000. Sababo la xiriira jawaabta aadka u badan iyo soo gudbinta cajiibka ah, waxaan go'aansanay inaan si yar u kordhino abaalmarinta, oo aan ku abaalmarinno kaalinta saddexaad afar qof oo midkiiba $500 ah. Guuleystayaasha waa kuwa hoos ku qoran, laakiin hubi inaad eegto dhammaan soo gudbinta <a %(annas_archive)s>halkan</a>, ama soo dejiso <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent-ka isku dhafan</a> ee annaga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first"
msgstr "Kaalinta koowaad $6,000: phiresky"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first.text1"
msgstr "Soo gudbintan <a %(phiresky_github)s> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>faallo Gitlab</a>) waa wax walba oo aan rabnay, iyo in ka badan! Waxaan si gaar ah u jeclaanay xulashooyinka muuqaalka aadka u dabacsan (xitaa taageeraya shaders gaar ah), laakiin leh liis dhammaystiran oo presets ah. Waxaan sidoo kale jeclaanay sida wax walba u dhakhso badan yihiin oo siman yihiin, hirgelinta fudud (oo aan xitaa lahayn backend), minimap-ka caqliga leh, iyo sharraxaadda ballaaran ee ku jirta <a %(phiresky_github)s>boostada blog-ka</a>. Shaqo cajiib ah, iyo guuleyste si wanaagsan u qalma!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Kaalinta labaad $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "Soo gudbin kale oo cajiib ah <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>. Ma aha mid sida kaalinta koowaad u dabacsan, laakiin dhab ahaantii waxaan doorbidnay muuqaalkeeda heerka macro-ka ee kaalinta koowaad (qalooca buuxinta booska, xuduudaha, calaamadaynta, muujinta, iyo soo dhawaynta). Faallo <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s> by Joe Davis ayaa nala qabsatay:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“In kasta oo laba jibbaaran iyo leydi ay yihiin kuwo xisaabeed ahaan raalli gelinaya, haddana ma bixiyaan meel sare oo heerka khariidada ah. Waxaan aaminsanahay in aan sinnayn ee ku jirta Hilbert ama Morton classic aysan ahayn cillad laakiin ay tahay astaamo. Sida muuqaalka kabaha ee caanka ah ee Talyaaniga uu ka dhigay mid si degdeg ah loo aqoonsan karo khariidada, \"qallooca\" gaarka ah ee qaloocyadan waxay noqon karaan calaamado garasho. Kala duwanaanshahan ayaa xoojin kara xusuusta meelaynta oo ka caawin kara isticmaalayaasha inay is-yaqaanaan, taasoo u sahlaysa inay helaan gobollo gaar ah ama ay ogaadaan qaababka.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Iyo weli xulashooyin badan oo loogu talagalay muuqaalka iyo sawiridda, iyo sidoo kale UI aad u siman oo dareen leh. Kaalinta labaad oo adag!"

