#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text2"
msgstr "Waxaan sii wadi karnaa in muddo ah, laakiin aan halkan ku joojino. Hubi inaad eegto dhammaan soo gudbinta <a %(annas_archive)s>halkan</a>, ama soo dejiso <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent-ka isku dhafan</a>. Soo gudbinta badan, mid kastaana wuxuu keenaa aragti gaar ah, ha ahaato UI ama hirgelin."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text3"
msgstr "Ugu yaraan waxaan ku dari doonaa soo gudbinta kaalinta koowaad boggayaga weyn, iyo qaar kale oo laga yaabo. Waxaan sidoo kale bilownay inaan ka fikirno sida loo abaabulo habka aqoonsiga, xaqiijinta, ka dibna loo kaydiyo buugaagta ugu naadirka ah. Wax badan ayaa ka iman doona dhinacan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text4"
msgstr "Waad ku mahadsan tihiin dhammaan ka qaybgalayaasha. Waa wax la yaab leh in dad badan ay danaynayaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.gratitude"
msgstr "Quluubtayadu waxay ka buuxaan mahadnaq."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.footer"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.title"
msgstr "Muuqaalka Dhammaan ISBNs — $10,000 abaalmarin ah marka la gaaro 2025-01-31"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.tldr"
msgstr "Sawirkan wuxuu matalayaa \"liiska buugaagta\" ugu weyn ee si buuxda u furan ee abid la soo ururiyey taariikhda aadanaha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text1"
msgstr "Sawirkan waa 1000×800 pixels. Mid kasta oo pixel ah wuxuu matalaa 2,500 ISBNs. Haddii aan hayno fayl ISBN ah, waxaan ka dhignaa pixel-kaas mid cagaar badan. Haddii aan ognahay in ISBN la bixiyay, laakiin aanan haysan fayl u dhigma, waxaan ka dhignaa mid casaan badan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text2"
msgstr "In ka yar 300kb, sawirkan si kooban ayuu u matalaa \"liiska buugaagta\" ugu weyn ee si buuxda u furan ee abid la soo ururiyey taariikhda aadanaha (dhowr boqol oo GB oo si buuxda loo cadaadiyay)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text3"
msgstr "Waxa kale oo ay muujinaysaa: shaqo badan ayaa ka dhiman kaydinta buugaagta (waxaan haynaa 16% oo kaliya)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background"
msgstr "Asalka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text1"
msgstr "Sidee ayaa Kaydka Anna u gaari karaa hadafkiisa ah inuu kaydiyo dhammaan aqoonta aadanaha, iyada oo aan la ogeyn buugaagta weli jirta? Waxaan u baahanahay liis TODO ah. Habka mid ah oo tan lagu sawiri karo waa iyada oo loo marayo lambarada ISBN, kuwaas oo tan iyo 1970-meeyadii loo qoondeeyay buug kasta oo la daabacay (dalal badan)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text2"
msgstr "Ma jiro hay'ad dhexe oo og dhammaan qoondeynta ISBN. Halkii, waa nidaam qayb-qaybsan, halkaas oo dalalku helaan xadadka lambarrada, kuwaas oo markaa u qoondeeyaan xadad yar oo daabacayaasha waaweyn, kuwaas oo markaa u sii qaybin kara xadadka daabacayaasha yaryar. Ugu dambeyntii lambarrada shaqsiga ah ayaa loo qoondeeyaa buugaagta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text3"
msgstr "Waxaan bilownay inaan sawirno ISBNs <a %(blog)s>laba sano ka hor</a> anagoo ka soo xoqnay ISBNdb. Tan iyo markaas, waxaan ka soo xoqnay ilo metadata oo badan, sida <a %(blog_2)s>Worldcat</a>, Google Books, Goodreads, Libby, iyo in ka badan. Liis buuxa waxaa laga heli karaa bogagga “Datasets” iyo “Torrents” ee Kaydka Anna. Hadda waxaan haynaa ururinta metadata buug oo si buuxda u furan, si fudud loo soo dejisan karo oo ugu weyn adduunka (iyo sidaas ISBNs)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text4"
msgstr "Waxaan <a %(blog)s>si ballaaran uga qornay</a> sababta aan u daneyneyno ilaalinta, iyo sababta aan hadda ugu jirno daaqad muhiim ah. Waa inaan hadda aqoonsanno buugaagta naadirka ah, kuwa aan la diiradda saarin, iyo kuwa si gaar ah halis ugu jira oo aan ilaalino. Helitaanka metadata wanaagsan ee dhammaan buugaagta adduunka waxay ka caawisaa taas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing"
msgstr "Muuqaalin"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text1"
msgstr "Marka laga soo tago sawirka guud, waxaan sidoo kale eegi karnaa datasets-ka shaqsiyeed ee aan helnay. Isticmaal hoos u dhaca iyo badhamada si aad ugu beddesho dhexdooda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text2"
msgstr "Waxaa jira qaabab xiiso leh oo badan oo lagu arko sawirradan. Maxay tahay sababta ay u jirto nidaam joogto ah oo xariijimo iyo baloogyada, taas oo u muuqata inay ka dhacdo miisaanno kala duwan? Maxay yihiin meelaha bannaan? Maxay yihiin sababta datasets-ka qaarkood ay u yihiin kuwo isku urursan? Su'aalahan waxaan uga tagi doonaa akhristaha sidii layli."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty"
msgstr "$10,000 abaalmarin"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text1"
msgstr "Waxaa jira wax badan oo lagu sahamin karo halkan, sidaas darteed waxaan ku dhawaaqeynaa abaalmarin si loo hagaajiyo muuqaalka kore. Si ka duwan inta badan abaalmarinnadayada, tan waxaa ku xaddidan waqti. Waa inaad <a %(annas_archive)s>soo gudbisaa</a> koodhkaaga il furan ka hor 2025-01-31 (23:59 UTC)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text2"
msgstr "Soo gudbinta ugu fiican waxay heli doontaa $6,000, kaalinta labaad waa $3,000, iyo kaalinta saddexaad waa $1,000. Dhammaan abaalmarinnada waxaa lagu bixin doonaa Monero (XMR)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text3"
msgstr "Hoos waxaa ku yaal shuruudaha ugu yar. Haddii aanay jirin wax soo gudbin ah oo buuxiya shuruudaha, waxaa laga yaabaa inaan weli abaalmarinno qaar ka mid ah abaalmarinnada, laakiin taas waxay ku xirnaan doontaa go'aankayaga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req1"
msgstr "Ka furqado repo-kan, oo wax ka beddel HTML-ka qoraalkan blog-ka (ma jiraan wax kale oo backend ah oo aan ahayn backend-ka Flask-keena)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req2"
msgstr "Ka dhig sawirka kore mid si siman loo weyneyn karo, si aad ugu weyneyn karto ISBN-yada shaqsiyeed. Gujinta ISBN-yada waa inay ku geynaysaa bogga metadata ama raadinta Kaydka Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req3"
msgstr "Waa inaad weli awood u leedahay inaad u beddesho dhammaan datasets-ka kala duwan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req4"
msgstr "Xadadka dalalka iyo xadadka daabacayaasha waa in la muujiyo marka la dul joogo. Waxaad isticmaali kartaa tusaale ahaan <a %(github_xlcnd_isbnlib)s>data4info.py ee isbnlib</a> si aad u hesho macluumaadka dalka, iyo xoqitaankayaga “isbngrp” ee daabacayaasha (<a %(annas_archive)s>dataset</a>, <a %(annas_archive_2)s>torrent</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req5"
msgstr "Waa inay si fiican uga shaqeyso desktop-ka iyo mobilka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text4"
msgstr "Si aad dhibco dheeraad ah u hesho (kuwan waa fikrado kaliya — hal-abuurkaaga ha ordo):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus1"
msgstr "Tixgelin xoog leh ayaa la siin doonaa isticmaalka iyo sida wanaagsan ee ay u muuqato."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus2"
msgstr "Tus metadata dhab ah oo loogu talagalay ISBN-yada shaqsiyeed marka la weyneynayo, sida cinwaanka iyo qoraaga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus3"
msgstr "Qalooca buuxinta booska oo ka wanaagsan. Tusaale ahaan, zig-zag, oo ka bilaabma 0 ilaa 4 safka koowaad ka dibna dib ugu noqda (si dib u noqosho ah) laga bilaabo 5 ilaa 9 safka labaad — si isdaba joog ah loo dabaqay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus4"
msgstr "Nidaamo midabyo kala duwan ama la beddeli karo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus5"
msgstr "Muuqaal gaar ah oo loogu talagalay isbarbardhigga Datasets."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus6"
msgstr "Habab lagu hagaajinayo dhibaatooyinka, sida metadata kale oo aan si fiican isugu waafaqsanayn (tusaale ahaan, cinwaanno aad u kala duwan)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus7"
msgstr "Sawirrada ku lifaaq faallooyin ku saabsan ISBN-yada ama xadadka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus8"
msgstr "Heerarka lagu aqoonsanayo buugaagta naadirka ah ama halista ku jira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.bonus9"
msgstr "Fikradaha hal-abuurka ah ee aad la timaado!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text5"
msgstr "Waxaad gebi ahaanba ka leexan kartaa shuruudaha ugu yar, oo waxaad samayn kartaa muuqaal gebi ahaanba ka duwan. Haddii ay runtii cajiib tahay, markaa waxay u qalantaa abaalmarinta, laakiin waa go'aankayaga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text6"
msgstr "Soo gudbiyaasha samee adigoo faallo ku soo qoraya <a %(annas_archive)s>arrintan</a> oo leh isku xirka repo-gaaga la faray, codsiga isdhexgalka, ama farqiga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.code"
msgstr "Koodh"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.code.text1"
msgstr "Koodhka lagu soo saaro sawirradan, iyo tusaalooyin kale, waxaa laga heli karaa <a %(annas_archive)s>galkan</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.code.text2"
msgstr "Waxaan la nimid qaab xog ururin kooban, kaas oo dhammaan macluumaadka ISBN ee loo baahan yahay uu yahay qiyaastii 75MB (la isku ururiyey). Sharaxaadda qaabka xogta iyo koodhka lagu soo saaro waxaa laga heli karaa <a %(annas_archive_l1244_1319)s>halkan</a>. Abaalmarinta uma baahnid inaad tan isticmaasho, laakiin waa qaabka ugu habboon ee lagu bilaabi karo. Waxaad u beddeli kartaa metadata-keena sida aad rabto (inkastoo dhammaan koodhkaagu uu noqdo mid furan)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.code.text3"
msgstr "Ma sugi karno inaan aragno waxaad la timaado. Nasiib wacan!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.title"
msgstr "Kaydka Anna (AAC): habeynta sii deynta maktabadda hooska ugu weyn adduunka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.tldr"
msgstr "Kaydka Anna wuxuu noqday maktabadda hooska ugu weyn adduunka, taasoo nagu qasbeysa inaan habeyno sii deyntayada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.text1"
msgstr "<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a> wuxuu noqday maktabadda hooska ugu weyn adduunka, iyo maktabadda hooska kaliya ee heerkeeda oo dhan ay tahay mid furan oo xog furan. Hoos waxaa ku yaal jadwal ka yimid bogga Datasets (wax yar ayaa la beddelay):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.text2"
msgstr "Waxaan ku guuleysanay tan saddex siyaabood:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.text2.li1"
msgstr "Ku dayashada maktabadaha hooska xogta furan ee jira (sida Sci-Hub iyo Library Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.text2.li2"
msgstr "Caawinta maktabadaha hooska ah ee doonaya inay noqdaan kuwo furan, laakiin aan haysan waqti ama agab ay sidaas ku sameeyaan (sida ururinta majaajilada Libgen)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.text2.li3"
msgstr "Xaqiijinta maktabadaha aan rabin inay wadaagaan si ballaaran (sida Z-Library)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.text3"
msgstr "(2) iyo (3) waxaan hadda maamulnaa uruurin ballaaran oo torrents ah annaga qudhayadu (100s oo TBs). Ilaa hadda waxaan u soo dhawaynay ururintan sidii hal mar, taasoo la micno ah kaabayaasha gaarka ah iyo habaynta xogta ee urur kasta. Tani waxay ku darsataa kharash weyn sii deynta kasta, waxayna si gaar ah u adkeyneysaa in la sameeyo sii deynyo dheeraad ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.text4"
msgstr "Taasi waa sababta aan u go'aansanay inaan mideyno sii deynteena. Tani waa qoraal blog farsamo ah oo aan ku soo bandhigayno heerkeena: <strong>Weelasha Kaydka Anna</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.heading"
msgstr "Hadafka naqshadeynta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.text1"
msgstr "Ujeedada ugu weyn ee isticmaalkeena waa qaybinta faylasha iyo metadata la xidhiidha ee ururinta kala duwan ee jira. Tixgelintaheena ugu muhiimsan waa:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal1"
msgstr "Faylasha iyo metadata kala duwan, sida ugu dhow ee suurtogalka ah qaabka asalka ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal2"
msgstr "Aqoonsiyo kala duwan oo ku jira maktabadaha isha, ama xitaa maqnaanshaha aqoonsiyada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal3"
msgstr "Sii deynyo kala duwan oo metadata ah vs xogta faylka, ama sii deynyo metadata oo keliya (tusaale ahaan sii deynta ISBNdb)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal4"
msgstr "Qaybinta iyada oo loo marayo torrents, in kastoo ay suurtogal tahay habab kale oo qaybinta (tusaale ahaan IPFS)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal5"
msgstr "Diiwaanno aan la beddeli karin, maadaama aan u qaadanayno in torrents-keena ay jiri doonaan weligood."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal6"
msgstr "Sii deynyo dheeraad ah / sii deynyo lagu dari karo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal7"
msgstr "Akhri iyo qori mashiin, si ku habboon oo degdeg ah, gaar ahaan stack-keena (Python, MySQL, ElasticSearch, Transmission, Debian, ext4)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal8"
msgstr "Si fudud in bini'aadamku baadho, in kastoo tani ay tahay mid labaad u ah akhrinta mashiinka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal9"
msgstr "Si fudud in lagu beero ururintayada iyadoo la isticmaalayo sanduuq beereed oo la kireysto oo caadi ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.goal10"
msgstr "Xogta binary waxaa si toos ah u adeegsan kara webservers sida Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.text2"
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah ujeedooyinka aan ahayn:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.nongoal1"
msgstr "Kuma daneyneyno in faylasha ay fududahay in gacanta lagu dhex maro diskiga, ama la raadiyo iyada oo aan la horay u habayn."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.nongoal2"
msgstr "Kuma daneyneyno in si toos ah loogu waafajiyo software-ka maktabadda ee jira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.nongoal3"
msgstr "In kasta oo ay tahay in qof kasta ay u fududahay inuu ku beero ururintayada iyadoo la isticmaalayo torrents, ma filayno in faylasha ay la isticmaali karo iyada oo aan la helin aqoon farsamo oo weyn iyo ballanqaad."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.text3"
msgstr "Maadaama Kaydka Anna uu yahay il furan, waxaan rabnaa inaan si toos ah u isticmaalno qaabkeena. Markaan cusbooneysiineyno tusaha raadinta, waxaan kaliya galnaa waddooyinka si guud loo heli karo, si qof kasta oo laamo ka sameeya maktabadeena uu si degdeg ah u bilaabi karo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.heading"
msgstr "Heerka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.text1"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, waxaan ku heshiinnay heer caadi ah oo fudud. Waa mid dabacsan, aan sharci ahayn, oo weli lagu shaqeynayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> AAC (Weelka Kaydka Anna) waa shay keliya oo ka kooban <strong>metadata</strong>, iyo ikhtiyaar ahaan <strong>xogta binary</strong>, labadaba waa kuwo aan la beddeli karin. Waxay leedahay aqoonsi gaar ah oo caalami ah, oo loo yaqaan <strong>AACID</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Ururinta.</strong> AAC kasta waxay ka tirsan tahay ururin, taas oo sida lagu qeexay ay tahay liis AACs ah oo macno ahaan is waafaqsan. Taasi waxay ka dhigan tahay haddii aad isbeddel weyn ku sameyso qaabka metadata, markaa waa inaad abuurtaa ururin cusub."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>“diiwaanno” iyo “faylal” ururinta.</strong> Sida caadiga ah, waxaa mararka qaar ku habboon in la sii daayo “diiwaanno” iyo “faylal” sidii ururino kala duwan, si ay ugu kala baxaan jadwal kala duwan, tusaale ahaan iyadoo lagu saleynayo heerarka xoqidda. “Diiwaan” waa ururin metadata oo keliya, oo ka kooban macluumaad sida cinwaannada buugaagta, qorayaasha, ISBNs, iwm, halka “faylal” ay yihiin ururinta ay ku jiraan faylasha dhabta ah (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Qaabka AACID waa sidan: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Tusaale ahaan, AACID dhab ah oo aan sii deynay waa <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: magaca ururinta, kaas oo ka koobnaan kara xarfaha ASCII, tirooyinka, iyo hooska (laakiin ma jiro hoos labanlaab ah)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: nooc gaaban oo ka mid ah ISO 8601, had iyo jeer UTC, tusaale ahaan <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Tiradani waa inay si joogto ah u kordhisaa siideynta kasta, in kastoo macnaha saxda ah uu kala duwanaan karo ururinta kasta. Waxaan soo jeedineynaa in la isticmaalo waqtiga xoqidda ama abuurista aqoonsiga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: aqoonsi gaar ah oo ururinta, haddii ay khuseyso, tusaale ahaan aqoonsiga Z-Library. Waxaa laga yaabaa in la dhaafo ama la gaabiyo. Waa in la dhaafo ama la gaabiyo haddii AACID uu ka badnaan lahaa 150 xaraf."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: UUID laakiin loo soo koobay ASCII, tusaale ahaan iyadoo la isticmaalayo base57. Waxaan hadda isticmaalnaa maktabadda Python <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>Xadka AACID.</strong> Maadaama AACIDs ay ka kooban yihiin timestamps si joogto ah u kordhaya, waxaan u isticmaali karnaa taas si aan u muujino xadadka ururin gaar ah. Waxaan isticmaalnaa qaabkan: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, halkaas oo timestamps ay ku jiraan. Tani waxay la jaanqaadaysaa qoraalka ISO 8601. Xadadka waa kuwo joogto ah, waxayna is dulfuuli karaan, laakiin haddii ay is dulfuulaan waa inay ku jiraan diiwaanno isku mid ah sidii hore loogu sii daayay ururintaas (maadaama AACs aan la beddeli karin). Diiwaanno maqan lama oggola."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Faylka metadata.</strong> Faylka metadata wuxuu ka kooban yahay metadata ee xadadka AACs, ururin gaar ah. Waxay leeyihiin sifooyinka soo socda:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.filename"
msgstr "Magaca faylka waa inuu noqdaa xadka AACID, oo lagu hormariyo <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> oo ay ku xigto <code>.jsonl.zstd</code>. Tusaale ahaan, mid ka mid ah sii deynteena waxaa loo yaqaan<br><code><span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z</span>.jsonl.zst</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.jsonlines"
msgstr "Sida lagu muujiyay kordhinta faylka, nooca faylka waa <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> oo lagu cadaadiyay <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.fields"
msgstr "Fayl kasta oo JSON ah waa inuu ka kooban yahay beeraha soo socda heerka ugu sarreeya: <strong>aacid</strong>, <strong>metadata</strong>, <strong>data_folder</strong> (ikhtiyaar ah). Ma jiraan beer kale oo la oggol yahay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.metadata"
msgstr "<code>metadata</code> waa metadata aan xadidnayn, sida macnaha ururinta. Waa inay macno ahaan is waafaqsan tahay ururinta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.data_folder"
msgstr "<code>data_folder</code> waa ikhtiyaar, waana magaca galka xogta binary ee ay ku jiraan xogta binary ee u dhiganta. Magaca faylka ee xogta binary ee ku jira galkaas waa AACID diiwaanka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.prefix"
msgstr "Hordhaca <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> waxaa lagu beddeli karaa magaca hay'addaada, tusaale ahaan <code style=\"color: red\">my_institute_meta__</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Galka xogta binary.</strong> Galku wuxuu ka kooban yahay xogta binary ee xadadka AACs, ururin gaar ah. Waxay leeyihiin sifooyinka soo socda:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Magaca galka waa inuu noqdaa xadka AACID, oo lagu hormariyo <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, oo aan lahayn dheeri. Tusaale ahaan, mid ka mid ah sii deynteena dhabta ah wuxuu leeyahay gal la yiraahdo<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "Galka waa inuu ka kooban yahay faylal xog ah oo dhan AACs ee xadka la cayimay. Fayl kasta oo xog ah waa inuu leeyahay AACID sida magaca faylka (aan lahayn kordhin)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "Waxaa lagu talinayaa in faylasha la sameeyo si ay u noqdaan kuwo la maamuli karo, tusaale ahaan, aan ka weynayn 100GB-1TB midkiiba, in kastoo taladan ay is beddeli karto waqti ka waqti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Torrents.</strong> Faylasha metadata iyo faylasha xogta binary-ga ah waxaa lagu soo ururin karaa torrents, mid torrent ahna waxaa loogu talagalay faylasha metadata, ama mid torrent ahna waxaa loogu talagalay faylasha xogta binary-ga ah. Torrents-ka waa inay lahaadaan magaca faylka/direktariga asalka ah oo lagu daray <code>.torrent</code> sida magaca faylka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Tusaale"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Aan eegno sii deyntii ugu dambeysay ee Z-Library tusaale ahaan. Waxay ka kooban tahay laba uruurin: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” iyo “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Tani waxay noo ogolaaneysaa inaan si gooni ah u uruurino oo aan u sii deyno diiwaanada metadata ee faylasha buugaagta dhabta ah. Sidaas darteed, waxaan sii deynay laba torrents oo leh faylasha metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "Waxaan sidoo kale sii deynay tiro badan oo torrents ah oo leh faylasha xogta binary-ga ah, laakiin kaliya uruurinta “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”, 62 guud ahaan:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Marka la ordo <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> waxaan arki karnaa waxa ku jira:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Xaaladdan, waa metadata ee buug sida ay soo sheegtay Z-Library. Heerka ugu sarreeya waxaan kaliya leenahay “aacid” iyo “metadata”, laakiin ma jiro “data_folder”, maadaama aysan jirin xog binary ah oo la jaanqaadaysa. AACID waxay ka kooban tahay “22430000” oo ah aqoonsiga ugu weyn, kaas oo aan arki karno in laga soo qaatay “zlibrary_id”. Waxaan filan karnaa AAC-yada kale ee uruurintan inay lahaadaan qaab dhismeed isku mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Hadda aan orodno <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Tani waa metadata AAC oo aad u yar, in kastoo inta badan AAC-kan ay ku taallo meel kale oo fayl binary ah! Ugu dambeyntii, waxaan leenahay “data_folder” markan, sidaas darteed waxaan filan karnaa xogta binary-ga ah ee la jaanqaadaysa inay ku taallo <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. “Metadata” waxay ka kooban tahay “zlibrary_id”, sidaas darteed waxaan si fudud ugu xiriirin karnaa AAC-ka la jaanqaadaya ee uruurinta “zlib_records”. Waxaan ku xiriirin karnaa siyaabo kala duwan, tusaale ahaan, iyada oo loo marayo AACID — heerka ma tilmaamayo taas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Ogsoonow in sidoo kale aysan daruuri ahayn in goobta “metadata” ay nafteeda noqoto JSON. Waxay noqon kartaa xarig ka kooban XML ama qaab xog kale. Xitaa waxaad ku kaydin kartaa macluumaadka metadata ee blob-ka binary-ga ah ee la jaanqaadaya, tusaale ahaan haddii ay tahay xog badan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Gunaanad"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Iyadoo la raacayo heerkan, waxaan sii deyn karnaa si tartiib tartiib ah, oo si fudud ugu dari karnaa ilo xog cusub. Waxaan horey u haynaa dhowr sii deyn xiiso leh oo ku jira tubta!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "Waxaan sidoo kale rajeyneynaa inay noqoto mid fudud in maktabadaha kale ee hooska ah ay ku daydaan uruurintayada. Ugu dambeyntii, hadafkeenu waa inaan ilaalino aqoonta iyo dhaqanka aadanaha weligeed, sidaas darteed, inta badan ee dib u celinta, waa ka sii wanaagsan tahay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Cusboonaysiinta Anna: kayd furan oo buuxa, ElasticSearch, 300GB+ oo dabool buugaag ah"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "Waxaan u shaqeynaynay saacad walba si aan u bixino beddel wanaagsan oo leh Kaydka Anna. Halkan waxaa ku yaal qaar ka mid ah waxyaabaha aan dhawaan gaarnay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "Iyadoo Z-Library ay hoos u dhacday iyo aasaasayaasheeda (la sheegay) in la xiray, waxaan u shaqeynaynay saacad walba si aan u bixino beddel wanaagsan oo leh Kaydka Anna (ma halkan ku xiriirin doono, laakiin waad ka raadin kartaa Google). Halkan waxaa ku yaal qaar ka mid ah waxyaabaha aan dhawaan gaarnay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "Kaydka Anna waa mid furan oo buuxa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "Waxaan aaminsanahay in macluumaadka uu yahay mid xor ah, iyo koodhkeena gaarka ah maaha mid ka reeban. Waxaan sii deynay dhammaan koodhkeena madalkeena Gitlab ee gaarka ah: <a %(annas_archive)s>Software-ka Anna</a>. Waxaan sidoo kale u isticmaalnaa raadraaca arrimaha si aan u abaabulno shaqadeena. Haddii aad rabto inaad ku lug yeelato horumarkeena, tani waa meel wanaagsan oo lagu bilaabo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Si aan kuugu siino dhadhan waxyaabaha aan ka shaqeyneyno, qaado shaqadeena dhawaan ee ku saabsan hagaajinta waxqabadka dhinaca macmiilka. Maadaama aanan weli hirgelin bogagga, waxaan badanaa soo celin jirnay bogag raadinta oo aad u dheer, oo leh 100-200 natiijo. Ma rabin inaan si dhakhso ah u joojino natiijooyinka raadinta, laakiin tani waxay ka dhigan tahay inay gaabisin doonto qaar ka mid ah qalabka. Tan awgeed, waxaan hirgelinay khiyaano yar: waxaan ku duubnay inta badan natiijooyinka raadinta faallooyinka HTML (<code><!-- --></code>), ka dibna waxaan qornay Javascript yar oo ogaan doona marka natiijo ay tahay inay muuqato, markaas waxaan ka furfuri lahayn faallada:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "DOM \"virtualization\" oo lagu hirgeliyay 23 xariiq, looma baahna maktabado casri ah! Tani waa nooca koodhka degdega ah ee aad ku dambaynayso marka aad haysato waqti xaddidan, iyo dhibaatooyin dhab ah oo u baahan in la xalliyo. Waxaa la soo sheegay in raadintayadu hadda si fiican ugu shaqeyso aaladaha gaabiska ah!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Dadaal kale oo weyn wuxuu ahaa in la otomaatigiyo dhismaha xogta. Markii aan bilownay, waxaan si aan kala sooc lahayn u soo ururinay ilo kala duwan. Hadda waxaan rabnaa inaan cusboonaysiino, sidaas darteed waxaan qornay qoraallo badan si aan u soo dejino metadata cusub oo ka socda labada farac ee Library Genesis, oo aan ku darno. Ujeedadu waa in aan ka dhigno mid faa'iido leh oo keliya kaydkeena, laakiin sidoo kale in aan u fududeyno qof kasta oo raba inuu ku ciyaaro metadata maktabadda hooska. Ujeedadu waxay noqon lahayd buugga Jupyter oo leh metadata xiiso leh oo kala duwan, si aan u sameyn karno cilmi baaris dheeraad ah sida ogaanshaha <a %(blog)s> boqolkiiba ISBN-yada la ilaaliyo weligood</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, waxaan dib u habeyn ku sameynay nidaamkayaga tabaruca. Hadda waxaad isticmaali kartaa kaarka deynta si toos ah ugu shub lacag jeebabkayaga crypto, adigoon runtii u baahnayn inaad wax ka ogaato cryptocurrencies. Waxaan sii wadi doonaa inaan la socono sida ay tani ugu shaqeyso ficil ahaan, laakiin tani waa arrin weyn."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "U beddel ElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "Mid ka mid ah <a %(annas_archive)s>tigidyada</a> waxay ahayd dhibaatooyin kala duwan oo ku saabsan nidaamkayaga raadinta. Waxaan isticmaalnay raadinta qoraalka buuxa ee MySQL, maadaama aan dhammaan xogtayada ku haysannay MySQL. Laakiin waxay lahayd xad:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah weydiimaha ayaa qaadanayay waqti aad u dheer, ilaa heer ay qabsadaan dhammaan isku xirka furan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "Sida caadiga ah MySQL waxay leedahay dhererka erayga ugu yar, ama tusmadaadu waxay noqon kartaa mid aad u weyn. Dadku waxay soo sheegeen inaysan awoodin inay raadiyaan “Ben Hur”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "Raadintu waxay ahayd mid si dhexdhexaad ah u degdeg ah marka si buuxda loogu raro xusuusta, taas oo nagu qasbeysa inaan helno mashiin qaali ah si aan tan ugu socodsiino, iyo sidoo kale amarrada qaar si aan u horay u rarno tusmada marka la bilaabayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "Ma awoodi lahayn inaan si fudud ugu kordhino si aan u dhisno astaamo cusub, sida <a %(wikipedia_cjk_characters)s>tokenization ka wanaagsan luqadaha aan lahayn meel bannaan</a>, shaandhaynta/qaabaynta, kala soocidda, talooyinka \"ma waxaad ula jeedaa\", autocomplete, iyo wixii la mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "Ka dib markii aan la hadalnay khubaro badan, waxaan ku heshiinay ElasticSearch. Ma aysan ahayn mid qumman (talooyinkooda caadiga ah ee \"ma waxaad ula jeedaa\" iyo astaamaha autocomplete waa liitaan), laakiin guud ahaan waxay ahayd mid aad uga wanaagsan MySQL ee raadinta. Weli ma nihin <a %(youtube)s>aad ugu qanacsan</a> isticmaalkeeda xogta muhiimka ah (inkastoo ay sameeyeen <a %(elastic_co)s>horumar</a> badan), laakiin guud ahaan aad ayaan ugu faraxsanahay beddelka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "Waqtigan xaadirka ah, waxaan hirgelinnay raadinta aad u dhakhso badan, taageerada luqadda wanaagsan, kala soocidda muhiimka ah ee wanaagsan, xulashooyinka kala soocidda kala duwan, iyo shaandhaynta luqadda/nooca buugga/nooca faylka. Haddii aad xiisaynayso sida ay u shaqeyso, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s>hays</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s>a</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s>fiiri</a>. Waa mid si fudud loo heli karo, in kastoo ay u baahan tahay faallooyin dheeraad ah…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "300GB+ oo daboolka buugga ah la sii daayay"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, waxaan ku faraxsanahay inaan ku dhawaaqno sii deyn yar. Anagoo kaashanayna dadka ka shaqeeya faraca Libgen.rs, waxaan wadaagnaa dhammaan daboolkooda buugga iyada oo loo marayo torrents iyo IPFS. Tani waxay u qaybin doontaa culeyska aragtida daboolka mashiinno badan, waxayna si fiican u ilaalin doontaa. Xaalado badan (laakiin ma aha dhammaan), daboolka buugga waxaa lagu daray faylasha laftooda, sidaas darteed tani waa nooc ka mid ah \"xogta laga soo qaatay\". Laakiin in lagu haysto IPFS weli waa mid aad waxtar u leh hawlgalka maalinlaha ah ee Anna’s Archive iyo faracyada kala duwan ee Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Sida caadiga ah, waxaad ka heli kartaa sii deyntan Maktabadda Burcad-badeedka (EDIT: loo wareejiyay <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>). Halkan kuma xidhna, laakiin si fudud ayaad u heli kartaa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Rajeynaynaa inaan yareyn karno xawaaraha shaqadeena, maadaama aan haysano beddel wanaagsan oo Z-Library ah. Shaqadani ma aha mid si gaar ah u waari karta. Haddii aad xiisaynayso inaad ka caawiso barnaamijyada, hawlgalka server-ka, ama shaqada ilaalinta, hubaal nala soo xiriir. Weli waxaa jira shaqo badan oo <a %(annas_archive)s>la qaban karo</a>. Waad ku mahadsan tahay xiisahaaga iyo taageeradaada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "Kaydka Anna wuxuu kaydiyay maktabadda ugu weyn ee hooska majaajillada adduunka (95TB) — waxaad ka caawin kartaa inaad abuurto"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Maktabadda ugu weyn ee hooska majaajillada adduunka waxay lahayd hal dhibic oo guuldarro ah.. ilaa maanta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s>Ka dood Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Maktabadda ugu weyn ee hooska majaajillada waxaa u badan mid ka mid ah faracyada Library Genesis gaar ah: Libgen.li. Maamulaha kaliya ee maamula goobtaas wuxuu ku guuleystay inuu ururiyo ururinta majaajillada waalan oo ka badan 2 milyan oo faylal ah, oo wadarta guud ay tahay in ka badan 95TB. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, si ka duwan ururinta kale ee Library Genesis, tan laguma heli karin si ballaaran iyada oo loo marayo torrents. Waxaad kaliya ku heli kartaa majaajilladan si shaqsi ah iyada oo loo marayo server-kiisa gaabiska ah ee shaqsiga ah — hal dhibic oo guuldarro ah. Ilaa maanta!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "Qoraalkan waxaan kuugu sheegi doonaa wax badan oo ku saabsan ururintan, iyo ku saabsan ololaha lacag ururinta ee taageerada shaqadan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>Dr. Barbara Gordon waxay isku dayeysaa inay isku lumiso adduunka caadiga ah ee maktabadda…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Laamaha Libgen"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Marka hore, taariikh yar. Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad taqaanid Library Genesis ururintooda buugaagta ee weyn. Dad yar ayaa og in mutadawiciinta Library Genesis ay abuureen mashaariic kale, sida ururin ballaaran oo joornaallo iyo dukumiintiyo heer caalami ah, kayd buuxa oo Sci-Hub ah (iyadoo lala kaashanayo aasaasaha Sci-Hub, Alexandra Elbakyan), iyo dhab ahaantii, ururin weyn oo majaajillo ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "Waqti ka dib, hawl-wadeenada kala duwan ee muraayadaha Library Genesis waxay qaadeen waddooyin kala duwan, taas oo keentay xaaladda hadda jirta ee lahaanshaha tiro kala duwan oo \"laamo\" ah, dhammaantoodna wali wata magaca Library Genesis. Laanta Libgen.li waxay si gaar ah u leedahay ururintan majaajillada, iyo sidoo kale ururin joornaallo oo ballaaran (taas oo aan sidoo kale ka shaqeyneyno)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Iskaashiga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Marka la eego cabbirkeeda, ururintan waxay muddo dheer ku jirtay liiskayaga rabitaanka, sidaas darteed ka dib guushayadii kaydinta Z-Library, waxaan u jeedsanay ururintan. Marka hore waxaan si toos ah uga soo xoqnay, taas oo ahayd caqabado badan, maadaama server-kooda aanu ku jirin xaalad wanaagsan. Waxaan helnay qiyaastii 15TB sidan, laakiin waxay ahayd mid gaabis ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Nasiib wanaag, waxaan ku guuleysanay inaan la xiriirno hawl-wadeenka maktabadda, kaas oo ogolaaday inuu si toos ah noogu soo diro dhammaan xogta, taas oo ahayd mid aad u dhakhso badan. Weli waxay qaadatay in ka badan nus sano in la wareejiyo oo la farsameeyo dhammaan xogta, waxaana ku dhowaad luminay dhammaanteed burburka diskiga, taas oo macnaheedu noqon lahaa inaan dib u bilowno."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Khibraddan ayaa nagu qancisay inay muhiim tahay in xogtan si dhakhso leh loo faafiyo, si ay ugu faafiso meel kasta. Waxaan nahay hal ama laba dhacdo oo nasiib darro ah oo ka fog inaan ururintan luminno weligeed!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Ururinta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Dhaqso u socoshadu waxay ka dhigan tahay in ururintu ay tahay mid aan si fiican loo habeynin… Aan eegno. Ka fikir inaan leenahay nidaam faylal ah (oo dhab ahaantii aan ku kala qaybinayno torrents):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Galka ugu horreeya, <code>/repository</code>, waa qaybta ugu habaysan ee tan. Galkan wuxuu ka kooban yahay waxa loogu yeero “kun dirs”: galal midkiiba leh kun faylal, kuwaas oo si tartiib tartiib ah loogu lambaray xogta. Galka <code>0</code> wuxuu ka kooban yahay faylal leh comic_id 0–999, iyo wixii la mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Tani waa isla nidaamka ay Library Genesis u isticmaashay ururinteeda sheekooyinka iyo kuwa aan sheekooyinka ahayn. Fikradda ayaa ah in “kun dir” kasta si toos ah loogu beddelo torrent marka uu buuxsamo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Si kastaba ha ahaatee, hawl-wadeenka Libgen.li waligiis ma sameyn torrents ururintan, sidaas darteed kun dirs waxay u badan tahay inay noqdeen kuwo aan habboonayn, oo ay u baneeyeen “dirs aan la kala soocin”. Kuwani waa <code>/comics0</code> ilaa <code>/comics4</code>. Dhammaantood waxay leeyihiin qaab-dhismeedyo galal oo gaar ah, kuwaas oo u muuqday inay macno u leeyihiin ururinta faylasha, laakiin hadda macno badan nooma sameynayaan. Nasiib wanaag, metadata weli si toos ah ayuu u tilmaamayaa dhammaan faylashaan, sidaas darteed habka kaydinta ee diskiga dhab ahaantii ma ahan mid muhiim ah!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "Metadata waxaa lagu heli karaa qaab MySQL database. Tan waxaa si toos ah looga soo dejisan karaa bogga Libgen.li, laakiin sidoo kale waxaan ka dhigi doonaa mid la heli karo torrent ahaan, oo ay weheliso miiska noo gaar ah oo leh dhammaan MD5 hashes."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis"
msgstr "Falanqeyn"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text1"
msgstr "Marka aad hesho 95TB oo lagu shubay kaydkaaga, waxaad isku dayeysaa inaad fahanto waxa xitaa ku jira… Waxaan sameynay falanqeyn si aan u aragno haddii aan yareyn karno cabbirka wax yar, sida in laga saaro nuqulada. Waa kuwan qaar ka mid ah waxyaabihii aan helnay:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item1"
msgstr "Nuqulada macnaha leh (sawirro kala duwan oo isla buugga ah) waxaa si aragti ahaan ah looga saari karaa, laakiin waa arrin adag. Markii aan si gacanta ah u eegnay majaajillada waxaan helnay tiro badan oo natiijooyin been ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item2"
msgstr "Waxaa jira nuqulo qaar oo kaliya ah MD5, taas oo ah mid si xad dhaaf ah u khasaaraya, laakiin ka saarista kuwaas waxay na siin lahayd qiyaastii 1% in kaydinta. Cabbirkan weli waa qiyaastii 1TB, laakiin sidoo kale, cabbirkan 1TB dhab ahaantii ma ahan mid muhiim ah. Waxaan doorbideynaa inaanan halis gelin inaan si shil ah u burburinno xogta habkan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item3"
msgstr "Waxaan helnay tiro badan oo xog aan buug ahayn, sida filimaan ku saleysan buugaagta majaajillada. Taasina waxay u muuqataa mid khasaaraysa, maadaama kuwaas ay horeyba si ballaaran loo heli karo siyaabo kale. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, waxaan ogaanay inaanan si fudud u shaandheyn karin faylasha filimada, maadaama ay jiraan sidoo kale <em>buugaag majaajillo is-dhexgal ah</em> oo lagu sii daayay kombiyuutarka, kuwaas oo qof duubay oo kaydiyay sida filimaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item4"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, wax kasta oo aan ka tirtiri karno ururinta waxay badbaadin lahayd boqolkiiba yar. Markaas ayaan xusuusannay inaan nahay kuwa xogta ururiya, iyo dadka nuqul ka samayn doona kuwaas oo sidoo kale ah kuwa xogta ururiya, sidaas darteed, “MAXAAD U JEEDAA, TIRTIR?!” :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text2"
msgstr "Sidaa darteed waxaan kuu soo bandhigaynaa ururinta oo dhan, oo aan waxba laga beddelin. Waa xog badan, laakiin waxaan rajeyneynaa in dad ku filan ay daneyn doonaan inay sii faafiyaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser"
msgstr "Ururinta Lacagta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text1"
msgstr "Waxaan sii deynaynaa xogtan qaybo waaweyn. Torrent-kii ugu horreeyay waa <code>/comics0</code>, kaas oo aan ku ridnay hal fayl weyn oo 12TB .tar ah. Taasi waxay ka fiican tahay diskigaaga adag iyo software-ka torrent-ka marka loo eego faylal yaryar oo badan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text2"
msgstr "Qayb ka mid ah sii deyntan, waxaan sameyneynaa ururinta lacagta. Waxaan raadineynaa inaan uruurino $20,000 si aan u daboolno kharashaadka hawlgalka iyo qandaraasyada ee ururintan, iyo sidoo kale inaan awood u siino mashaariicda socda iyo kuwa mustaqbalka. Waxaan haynaa qaar <em>aad u waaweyn</em> oo shaqo ku jira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text3"
msgstr "<em>Yaa aan taageerayo marka aan deeq bixiyo?</em> Si kooban: waxaan taageereynaa kaydinta dhammaan aqoonta iyo dhaqanka aadanaha, oo aan si fudud u heli karno. Dhammaan koodhka iyo xogtayadu waa il furan, waxaan nahay mashruuc si buuxda u socda oo ay maamulaan mutadawiciin, waxaanan ilaa hadda badbaadinay 125TB oo buugaag ah (marka lagu daro torrents-ka Libgen iyo Scihub ee jira). Ugu dambeyntii waxaan dhiseynaa mashiin wareeg ah oo awood u siinaya oo dhiirigelinaya dadka inay helaan, iskaanka, iyo kaydiyaan dhammaan buugaagta adduunka. Waxaan ka qori doonaa qorshaheenna weyn qoraal mustaqbalka ah. :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text4"
msgstr "Haddii aad deeq bixiso oo aad hesho xubinnimada “Amazing Archivist” ee 12 bilood ($780), waxaad heli doontaa <strong>“adopt a torrent”</strong>, taasoo macnaheedu yahay inaan magacaaga isticmaali doono ama fariin ku qori doono magaca faylka mid ka mid ah torrents-ka!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text5"
msgstr "Waxaad deeq ku bixin kartaa adigoo aadaya <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a> oo gujinaya badhanka “Donate”. Waxaan sidoo kale raadineynaa mutadawiciin dheeraad ah: injineerada software-ka, cilmi-baarayaasha amniga, khubarada ganacsiga qarsoon, iyo turjubaanada. Waxaad sidoo kale na taageeri kartaa adigoo bixiya adeegyada martigelinta. Dabcan, fadlan sii faafi torrents-keena!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Waad ku mahadsan tahay qof walba oo si deeqsinimo leh noo taageeray! Runtii waxaad sameyneysaa farqi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
msgstr "Halkan waxaa ku yaal torrents-ka ilaa hadda la sii daayay (weli waxaan ku jirnaa habaynta inta kale):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text8"
msgstr "Dhammaan torrents-ka waxaa laga heli karaa <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a> hoos “Datasets” (ma aanan ku xirin si toos ah, si xiriiriyeyaasha blog-kan aan looga saarin Reddit, Twitter, iwm). Halkaas, raac xiriiriyaha bogga Tor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next"
msgstr "Maxaa xiga?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text1"
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah torrents-ka ayaa ku fiican kaydinta muddada dheer, laakiin ma ahan mid aad u wanaagsan helitaanka maalinlaha ah. Waxaan la shaqeyn doonaa la-hawlgalayaasha martigelinta si aan xogtan oo dhan ugu helno webka (maadaama Kaydka Anna aanu si toos ah wax u martigelin). Dabcan waxaad ka heli doontaa xiriiriyeyaasha soo dejinta ee Kaydka Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text2"
msgstr "Waxaan sidoo kale ku martiqaadeynaa qof walba inuu wax ku sameeyo xogtan! Naga caawi inaan si fiican u falanqeyno, u nuqulno, ku ridno IPFS, dib u habeyno, ku tababbarno moodooyinkaaga AI, iyo wixii la mid ah. Waa dhammaantiin, mana sugi karno inaan aragno waxaad ku sameyneysaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text3"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, sida hore loo sheegay, weli waxaan haynaa sii deynno waaweyn oo soo socda (haddii <em>qof</em> si <em>shil ah</em> noogu soo diro xogta <em>gaar ah</em> ee ACS4, waad ogtahay meesha aan joogno…), iyo sidoo kale dhisidda mashiinka wareega ee kaydinta dhammaan buugaagta adduunka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text4"
msgstr "Sidaa darteed la soco, waxaanu hadda bilownay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.title"
msgstr "3x buugaag cusub ayaa lagu daray Muraayadda Maktabadda Burcad-badeedka (+24TB, 3.8 milyan buug)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text1"
msgstr "Sii deyntii asalka ahayd ee Muraayadda Maktabadda Burcad-badeedka (EDIT: loo wareejiyay <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>), waxaan ka sameynay muraayad Z-Library, ururin buugaag sharci-darro ah oo weyn. Sida xusuusin, tani waa waxa aan ku qornay qoraalkii asalka ahaa ee blog-ka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text1"
msgstr "Z-Library waa maktabad caan ah (oo sharci-darro ah). Waxay qaateen ururinta Library Genesis oo ka dhigeen mid si fudud loo raadin karo. Intaa waxaa dheer, waxay noqdeen kuwo aad u waxtar leh marka ay timaado helitaanka buugaag cusub, iyagoo dhiirigelinaya isticmaalayaasha wax ku biiriya faa'iidooyin kala duwan. Hadda ma aysan soo celin buugaagta cusub ee Library Genesis. Oo ka duwan Library Genesis, ma aysan ka dhigin ururintooda mid si fudud loo nuqulan karo, taasoo ka hortagaysa kaydinta ballaaran. Tani waa muhiim u ah qaabka ganacsigooda, maadaama ay lacag ka qaadaan helitaanka ururintooda si ballaaran (in ka badan 10 buug maalintii)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text2"
msgstr "Ma sameyno xukunno akhlaaqeed oo ku saabsan lacag qaadashada si loo helo buugaag sharci darro ah oo tiro badan. Shaki kuma jiro in Z-Library ay ku guuleysatay ballaarinta helitaanka aqoonta, iyo helitaanka buugaag badan. Waxaan halkan u joognaa inaan qaybteenna ka qaadanno: hubinta in ururintan gaar loo leeyahay la ilaaliyo muddo dheer."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text2"
msgstr "Ururintaas waxay dib ugu noqotay bartamihii 2021. Inta lagu guda jiro, Z-Library waxay ku koraysay heer aad u sarreeya: waxay ku dareen qiyaastii 3.8 milyan oo buug cusub ah. Waxaa jira nuqullo ku jira, hubaal, laakiin inta badan waxay u muuqataa inay yihiin buugaag cusub oo sharci ah, ama sawirro tayo sare leh oo buugaag hore loo soo gudbiyay. Tani waxay inta badan sabab u tahay tirada kordhay ee kormeerayaasha mutadawiciinta ah ee Z-Library, iyo nidaamkooda bulk-upload oo leh deduplication. Waxaan jeclaan lahayn inaan ku hambalyeyno guulahan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text3"
msgstr "Waxaan ku faraxsanahay inaan ku dhawaaqno inaan helnay dhammaan buugaagtii lagu daray Z-Library intii u dhaxaysay muraayaddeennii ugu dambeysay iyo Agoosto 2022. Waxaan sidoo kale dib ugu noqonnay oo ka soo xoqnay buugaag aan markii hore seegnay. Dhammaan, ururintan cusub waa qiyaastii 24TB, taas oo aad uga weyn tii hore (7TB). Muraayaddeennu hadda waa 31TB guud ahaan. Mar kale, waxaan ka soo saarnay nuqullo ka dhan ah Library Genesis, maadaama ay horey u jiraan torrents loo heli karo ururintaas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text4"
msgstr "Fadlan u tag Pirate Library Mirror si aad u hubiso ururinta cusub (EDIT: loo wareejiyay <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>). Waxaa jira macluumaad dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan sida faylasha loo habeeyey, iyo waxa is beddelay tan iyo markii ugu dambeysay. Kama xiri doonnaan halkan, maadaama tani ay tahay kaliya bog blog ah oo aan martigelin waxyaabo sharci darro ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text5"
msgstr "Dabcan, seeding sidoo kale waa hab weyn oo aad noogu caawin karto. Waad ku mahadsan tihiin dhammaan kuwa seeding-ka sameynaya set-kii hore ee torrents-keena. Waxaan ku faraxsanahay jawaabta wanaagsan, oo waxaan ku faraxsanahay in ay jiraan dad badan oo daneynaya ilaalinta aqoonta iyo dhaqanka habkan aan caadiga ahayn."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.title"
msgstr "Sida loo noqdo kaydiyaha burcad-badeedka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.tldr"
msgstr "Caqabadda ugu horreysa waxay noqon kartaa mid la yaab leh. Ma aha dhibaato farsamo, ama dhibaato sharci. Waa dhibaato nafsi ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates"
msgstr "Kahor inta aanan u gelin, laba cusbooneysiin oo ku saabsan Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: loo wareejiyay <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item1"
msgstr "Waxaan helnay deeqo aad u deeqsinimo leh. Midda koowaad waxay ahayd $10k oo ka timid qof aan la aqoon oo sidoo kale taageerayay \"bookwarrior\", aasaasihii asalka ahaa ee Library Genesis. Mahad gaar ah ayaa u socota bookwarrior oo fududeeyay deeqdan. Midda labaad waxay ahayd $10k kale oo ka timid deeq-bixiye aan la aqoon, oo nala soo xiriiray kadib sii deyntii ugu dambeysay, oo dhiirigeliyay inuu caawiyo. Waxaan sidoo kale helnay tiro deeqo yaryar. Aad baad ugu mahadsan tihiin taageeradiinna deeqsinimada leh. Waxaan haynaa mashaariic cusub oo xiiso leh oo ku jira dhuumaha taas oo ay taageeri doonto, markaa la soco."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item2"
msgstr "Waxaan la kulannay dhibaatooyin farsamo oo ku saabsan cabbirka sii deyntayadii labaad, laakiin torrents-keena waa kor oo hadda seeding. Waxaan sidoo kale helnay dalab deeqsinimo leh oo ka yimid qof aan la aqoon si uu u seeding ururintayada server-yadooda xawaare aad u sarreeya, sidaas darteed waxaan sameyneynaa upload gaar ah oo ku saabsan mashiinnadooda, ka dibna qof kasta oo kale oo soo dejinaya ururinta waa inuu arkaa horumar weyn oo xawaare ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text1"
msgstr "Buugaag dhan ayaa laga qori karaa sababta <em> ee ilaalinta dhijitaalka guud ahaan, iyo kaydinta burcad-badeedka gaar ahaan, laakiin aan siino hordhac degdeg ah kuwa aan aad u aqoon. Dunidu waxay soo saartaa aqoon iyo dhaqan ka badan sidii hore, laakiin sidoo kale wax badan ayaa lumaya sidii hore. Aadanaha waxay inta badan ku aaminaan shirkadaha sida daabacayaasha tacliinta, adeegyada qulqulka, iyo shirkadaha warbaahinta bulshada dhaxalkan, waxayna marar badan aysan noqonin ilaaliyeyaal wanaagsan. Fiiri filimka dukumenteriga ah ee Digital Amnesia, ama dhab ahaantii hadal kasta oo uu jeediyo Jason Scott."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text2"
msgstr "Waxaa jira hay'ado qaar oo shaqo wanaagsan ka qabta kaydinta intii karaankooda ah, laakiin waxaa xaddidaya sharciga. Annaga oo ah burcad-badeed, waxaan ku jirnaa boos gaar ah oo aan ku kaydin karno ururinta aanay taaban karin, sababtoo ah fulinta xuquuqda daabacaadda ama xayiraadaha kale. Waxaan sidoo kale ku nuqulan karnaa ururinta marar badan, adduunka oo dhan, sidaas darteed kordhinta fursadaha ilaalinta saxda ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text3"
msgstr "Waqtigan xaadirka ah, ma geli doonno doodaha ku saabsan faa'iidooyinka iyo khasaaraha hantida aqooneed, akhlaaqda jebinta sharciga, fikirka ku saabsan xayiraadda, ama arrinta helitaanka aqoonta iyo dhaqanka. Markaa intaas oo dhan meesha laga saaray, aan u galno sida <em>. Waxaan la wadaagi doonaa sida kooxdayadu u noqotay kaydiyayaal burcad-badeed, iyo casharrada aan barannay intii aan soconnay. Waxaa jira caqabado badan markaad safarkan ku bilaabayso, waxaana rajeyneynaa inaan kaa caawin karno qaar ka mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community"
msgstr "Bulshada"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text1"
msgstr "Caqabadda ugu horreysa waxay noqon kartaa mid la yaab leh. Ma aha dhibaato farsamo, ama dhibaato sharci. Waa dhibaato nafsi ah: shaqadan oo lagu qabto hooska waxay noqon kartaa mid aad u cidlo ah. Iyadoo ku xiran waxaad qorsheyneyso inaad sameyso, iyo qaabkaaga khatarta, waxaad u baahan kartaa inaad aad u taxaddarto. Dhinaca kale ee spectrum-ka waxaan leenahay dad sida Alexandra Elbakyan*, aasaasaha Sci-Hub, oo aad ugu furan hawlaheeda. Laakiin waxay ku jirtaa khatar sare oo ah in la xiro haddii ay booqato waddan galbeed ah waqtigan, waxayna wajihi kartaa tobanaan sano oo xabsi ah. Ma tahay khatar aad diyaar u tahay inaad qaadato? Annagu waxaan ku jirnaa dhinaca kale ee spectrum-ka; aad u taxaddar inaanan ka tagin wax raad ah, oo aan leenahay amni hawleed oo xooggan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text2"
msgstr "* Sida lagu sheegay HN by \"ynno\", Alexandra markii hore ma rabin in la ogaado: \"Server-yadeeda waxaa loo dejiyay inay soo saaraan fariimaha qaladka faahfaahsan ee PHP, oo ay ku jiraan dariiqa buuxa ee faylka isha ee khaldan, kaas oo ku hoos jiray galka /home/ringo-ring, kaas oo loo raaci karay magac isticmaale oo ay ku lahayd goob aan la xiriirin, oo ku xiran magaceeda dhabta ah. Kahor intaan la helin, waxay ahayd mid aan la aqoon.\" Sidaa darteed, isticmaal magacyo isticmaale oo aan caadi ahayn kombuyuutarada aad u isticmaasho waxyaalahan, haddii ay dhacdo inaad khalad ku sameyso wax."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text3"
msgstr "Sirtaas, si kastaba ha ahaatee, waxay la timaadaa kharash nafsi ah. Dadka intooda badan waxay jecel yihiin in la aqoonsado shaqada ay qabtaan, haddana ma qaadan kartid wax abaalmarin ah nolosha dhabta ah. Xitaa waxyaabaha fudud ayaa noqon kara caqabad, sida saaxiibbada oo ku weydiinaya waxaad ku mashquulsanayd (waqti ka dib \"ku ciyaarista NAS / homelab\" way duugowdaa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text4"
msgstr "Tani waa sababta ay muhiim u tahay in la helo bulsho. Waxaad ka tanaasuli kartaa amniga hawleed adigoo ku kalsoon saaxiibo aad u dhow, oo aad ogtahay inaad si qoto dheer ugu kalsoonaan karto. Xitaa markaa ka taxaddar inaadan waxba qorin, haddii ay dhacdo inay u baahan yihiin inay u dhiibaan emaylkooda mas'uuliyiinta, ama haddii qalabkooda la jabsado si kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text5"
msgstr "Waxaa ka sii wanaagsan inaad hesho burcad-badeed kale. Haddii saaxiibbadaada dhow ay xiiseynayaan inay kugu soo biiraan, waa weyn! Haddii kale, waxaad awoodi kartaa inaad kuwa kale ka hesho khadka tooska ah. Nasiib darro tani weli waa bulsho niche ah. Ilaa hadda waxaan helnay tiro yar oo kale oo firfircoon oo ku jira booskan. Meelo wanaagsan oo lagu bilaabi karo waxay u muuqdaan inay yihiin forums-ka Library Genesis, iyo r/DataHoarder. Kooxda Archive sidoo kale waxay leeyihiin shakhsiyaad isku fikir ah, in kasta oo ay ka shaqeeyaan sharciga gudahiisa (xitaa haddii ay ku jiraan meelaha cawlan ee sharciga). Dhaqanka dhaqameed ee \"warez\" iyo burcad-badeednimada sidoo kale waxay leeyihiin dad u fikiraya si la mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text6"
msgstr "Waxaan u furanahay fikradaha ku saabsan sida loo kobciyo bulshada loona sahmiyo fikradaha. Si xor ah noogu soo dir fariin Twitter ama Reddit. Waxaa laga yaabaa inaan martigelino nooc ka mid ah madal ama koox wada sheekeysi. Caqabad ka mid ah waa in tani si fudud loo xakameyn karo marka la isticmaalayo barnaamijyada caadiga ah, sidaas darteed waa inaan annagu martigelinaa. Waxaa sidoo kale jira is-weydaarsi u dhexeeya in doodahan si buuxda loo furo (ka-qaybgalka suurtagalka ah ee badan) iyo in la gaarsiiyo mid gaar ah (in aan la ogeysiin \"bartilmaameedyada\" suurtagalka ah in aan ku dhow nahay in aan ka xoqno). Waa inaan ka fikirnaa taas. Noo soo sheeg haddii aad xiisaynayso arrintan!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects"
msgstr "Mashaariicda"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text1"
msgstr "Marka aan sameyno mashruuc, wuxuu leeyahay dhowr weji:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase1"
msgstr "Xulashada domain / falsafada: Halkee ayaad rabtaa inaad diirada saarto, maxaase sabab u ah? Waa maxay xiisahaaga gaarka ah, xirfadahaaga, iyo duruufahaaga oo aad u adeegsan karto faa'iidadaada?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase2"
msgstr "Xulashada bartilmaameedka: Ururinta gaarka ah ee aad ku dayn doonto?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase3"
msgstr "Xoqidda metadata: Diiwaangelinta macluumaadka ku saabsan faylasha, adigoon dhab ahaantii soo dejin faylasha (inta badan aad u weyn)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase4"
msgstr "Xulashada xogta: Iyada oo ku saleysan metadata, hoos u dhigista xogta ugu habboon ee hadda la kaydinayo. Wax walba way noqon karaan, laakiin inta badan waxaa jira hab macquul ah oo lagu badbaadiyo booska iyo bandwidth-ka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase5"
msgstr "Xoqidda xogta: Dhab ahaantii helitaanka xogta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase6"
msgstr "Qaybinta: Ku xirxirida torrents, ku dhawaaqida meel, helitaanka dadka si ay u faafiyaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text2"
msgstr "Kuwani ma aha wejiyo si buuxda u madax-bannaan, waxaana badanaa aragtiyo ka yimaada weji dambe oo ku celinaya weji hore. Tusaale ahaan, inta lagu jiro xoqidda metadata waxaad ogaan kartaa in bartilmaameedka aad dooratay uu leeyahay habab difaac oo ka baxsan heerkaaga xirfadeed (sida xannibaadaha IP), markaa waxaad dib ugu noqotaa oo aad heshaa bartilmaameed kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain"
msgstr "1. Xulashada domain / falsafada"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text1"
msgstr "Ma jiro yaraanta aqoonta iyo dhaxalka dhaqameed ee la badbaadinayo, taas oo noqon karta mid culus. Taasi waa sababta ay inta badan faa'iido u leedahay in la qaato waqti yar oo la fikiro waxa ay noqon karto wax ku biirintaada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text2"
msgstr "Qof kastaa wuxuu leeyahay hab ka duwan oo uu uga fikiro arrintan, laakiin halkan waxaa ku yaal su'aalo aad isweydiin karto:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.why"
msgstr "Maxaad ugu xiisaynaysaa tan? Maxaad ku xiisaynaysaa? Haddii aan heli karno dad badan oo dhammaantood kaydiya noocyada waxyaabaha ay si gaar ah u daneeyaan, taas waxay dabooli lahayd wax badan! Waxaad ka ogaan doontaa wax badan qofka celceliska ah ee ku saabsan xiisahaaga, sida xogta muhiimka ah ee la badbaadinayo, ururinta ugu fiican iyo bulshooyinka internetka, iyo wixii la mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.skills"
msgstr "Waa maxay xirfadaha aad leedahay oo aad u adeegsan karto faa'iidadaada? Tusaale ahaan, haddii aad tahay khabiir amniga internetka, waxaad heli kartaa siyaabo lagu jebiyo xannibaadaha IP ee bartilmaameedyada amniga leh. Haddii aad ku fiican tahay abaabulka bulshooyinka, markaa waxaa laga yaabaa inaad dad ku soo ururiso ujeedo. Waa faa'iido in la ogaado barnaamijyo qaar, haddii aan ahayn oo kaliya in la ilaaliyo amniga hawlgalka wanaagsan inta lagu jiro habkan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.time"
msgstr "Intee in le'eg ayaad u haysaa tan? Talooyinkayagu waxay noqon lahaayeen inaad ku bilowdo wax yar oo aad sameyso mashaariic waaweyn marka aad ku baratid, laakiin waxay noqon kartaa mid ku mashquulsan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.target"
msgstr "Waa maxay aag sare oo lagu diiradda saari karo? Haddii aad ku bixinayso saacado X ah kaydinta burcad-badeedka, markaa sidee ayaad u heli kartaa \"bang for your buck\" ugu weyn?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.thinking"
msgstr "Waa maxay siyaabaha gaarka ah ee aad uga fikirayso arrintan? Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad leedahay fikrado ama habab xiiso leh oo ay dadka kale seegaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text3"
msgstr "Xaaladdayada, waxaan si gaar ah u danaynaynay ilaalinta muddada dheer ee sayniska. Waxaan ka warqabnay Library Genesis, iyo sida ay si buuxda loogu dayday marar badan iyadoo la isticmaalayo torrents. Waxaan jeclaanay fikraddaas. Kadib maalin maalmaha ka mid ah, midkeen ayaa isku dayay inuu ka helo buugaagta sayniska ee Library Genesis, laakiin ma heli karin, taasoo shaki gelisay sida dhammaystiran ee ay dhab ahaantii ahayd. Markaasaan ka raadinay buugaagtaas internetka, waxaanan ka helnay meelo kale, taasoo abuuray abuurka mashruucayaga. Xitaa ka hor intaanan ka warqabin Z-Library, waxaan haysanay fikradda ah inaan isku dayin inaan si gacanta ah u uruurinno dhammaan buugaagtaas, laakiin inaan diirada saarno in aan ku dayno ururinta jira, oo aan ku biirino Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target"
msgstr "2. Xulashada bartilmaameedka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text1"
msgstr "Marka aan helnay aagga aan eegayno, hadda waa maxay ururinta gaarka ah ee aan ku dayno? Waxaa jira dhowr waxyaalood oo ka dhigaya bartilmaameed wanaagsan:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.large"
msgstr "Weyn"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.unique"
msgstr "Gaar ah: aan horey loogu daboolin mashaariic kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.accessible"
msgstr "La heli karo: ma isticmaalo lakabyo badan oo ilaalin ah si looga hortago inaad ka soo gurto metadata iyo xogtooda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.insight"
msgstr "Aragti gaar ah: waxaad leedahay macluumaad gaar ah oo ku saabsan bartilmaameedkan, sida inaad si gaar ah u hesho ururintan, ama aad ogaatay sida loo jebiyo difaacooda. Tani looma baahna (mashruuceena soo socda ma sameeyo wax gaar ah), laakiin waxay hubaal ka caawisaa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text2"
msgstr "Markii aan ka helnay buugaagta sayniska ee boggaga internetka ee aan ahayn Library Genesis, waxaan isku daynay inaan ogaano sida ay ugu soo galeen internetka. Kadib waxaan helnay Z-Library, waxaana ogaanay in inkastoo buugaagta badankood aysan marka hore halkaas ka soo muuqan, haddana ugu dambeyntii halkaas ayey ku dhammaadaan. Waxaan baranay xiriirka ay la leedahay Library Genesis, iyo qaab-dhismeedka dhiirigelinta (dhaqaale) iyo is-dhexgalka isticmaale ee ka wanaagsan, labaduba waxay ka dhigeen ururin aad u dhammaystiran. Kadib waxaan sameynay metadata iyo xog ururin hordhac ah, waxaana ogaanay inaan ka gudbi karno xadidaadaha soo dejinta IP-ga, annagoo ka faa'iideysanayna mid ka mid ah xubnaheena oo si gaar ah u heli kara server-yada wakiilka badan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text3"
msgstr "Markaad baadhayso bartilmaameedyada kala duwan, waxaa horey muhiim u ah inaad qariso raadadkaaga adoo isticmaalaya VPN-yada iyo cinwaanada email-ka ee la tuuro, taas oo aan ka hadli doono wax badan goor dambe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata"
msgstr "3. Metadata ururinta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text1"
msgstr "Aan noqono kuwo farsamo ahaan yar. Si dhab ah loogu ururiyo metadata bogagga internetka, waxaan u haynay waxyaabo aad u fudud. Waxaan isticmaalnaa qoraallada Python, mararka qaarkood curl, iyo MySQL database si aan ugu kaydino natiijooyinka. Ma aanan isticmaalin wax software ururin casri ah oo sawiri kara boggaga internetka ee adag, maadaama ilaa hadda aan kaliya u baahnayn inaan ka ururino hal ama laba nooc oo bogag ah annagoo kaliya ku tirinayna ids iyo ka baaraandegida HTML. Haddii aysan jirin bogag si fudud loo tirin karo, markaa waxaad u baahan kartaa crawler sax ah oo isku dayaya inuu helo dhammaan bogagga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text2"
msgstr "Kahor intaadan bilaabin inaad ka ururiso bogga oo dhan, isku day inaad si gacanta ah u sameyso wax yar. Ka gudub dhowr iyo toban bog adigu, si aad u hesho dareen sida ay u shaqeyso. Mararka qaarkood waxaad horeyba ugu dhici doontaa xannibaadaha IP-ga ama dabeecadaha kale ee xiisaha leh habkan. Isla sidaas ayaa loo sameeyaa xog ururinta: ka hor intaadan aad ugu sii dhex galin bartilmaameedkan, hubi inaad si wax ku ool ah u soo dejisan karto xogtiisa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text3"
msgstr "Si aad uga gudubto xannibaadaha, waxaa jira dhowr waxyaalood oo aad isku dayi karto. Ma jiraan cinwaanno IP kale ama server-yada oo martigeliya xogta isla markaana aan lahayn xannibaadahaas? Ma jiraan wax API endpoints ah oo aan lahayn xannibaado, halka kuwa kale ay leeyihiin? Heerka soo dejinta ee IP-gaaga la xannibo, iyo mudada intee le'eg? Mise laguma xannibo laakiin hoos ayaa lagu dhigayaa? Ka waran haddii aad sameysato akoon isticmaale, sidee bay wax isu beddelaan markaa? Ma isticmaali kartaa HTTP/2 si aad u sii furan karto xiriirada, ma waxayna kordhisaa heerka aad ku codsan karto bogagga? Ma jiraan bogag liiska faylasha badan hal mar, iyo ma ku filan tahay macluumaadka halkaas ku qoran?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text4"
msgstr "Waxyaabaha aad u badan tahay inaad rabto inaad keydiso waxaa ka mid ah:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.title"
msgstr "Cinwaan"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.location"
msgstr "Magaca faylka / goobta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.id"
msgstr "ID: waxay noqon kartaa ID gudaha ah, laakiin IDs sida ISBN ama DOI waa kuwo waxtar leh sidoo kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.size"
msgstr "Cabbirka: si loo xisaabiyo inta boos ee diskiga aad u baahan tahay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.hash"
msgstr "Hash (md5, sha1): si loo xaqiijiyo inaad si sax ah u soo dejisay faylka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.dates"
msgstr "Taariikhda lagu daray/la beddelay: si aad dib ugu soo laabato oo aad u soo dejiso faylasha aadan horay u soo dejisan (inkastoo aad inta badan sidoo kale isticmaali karto ID ama hash tan)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.notes"
msgstr "Sharaxaad, qayb, tags, qorayaasha, luqadda, iwm."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text5"
msgstr "Caadi ahaan waxaan tan ku sameynaa laba marxaladood. Marka hore waxaan soo dejineynaa faylasha HTML-ka ah ee aan la sifeynin, badanaa si toos ah ugu jira MySQL (si aan looga fogaado faylasha yaryar ee badan, taas oo aan ka hadli doono wax badan hoos). Kadib, talaabo gooni ah, waxaan ka gudubnaa faylasha HTML-ka ah oo waxaan u kala saarno miisaska MySQL ee dhabta ah. Sidan uma baahnid inaad dib u soo dejiso wax walba haddii aad ogaato khalad ku jira koodhkaaga sifeynta, maadaama aad dib u habeyn karto faylasha HTML-ka ah koodhka cusub. Sidoo kale inta badan way fududahay in la kala qaybiyo talaabada habeynta, sidaas darteedna waqti ayaa la badbaadin karaa (waxaadna qori kartaa koodhka habeynta inta ururinta ay socoto, halkii aad ka qori lahayd labada talaabo mar wada)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text6"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, ogow in qaar ka mid ah bartilmaameedyada ay metadata xoqidda tahay waxa kaliya ee jira. Waxaa jira ururinta metadata oo waaweyn oo aan si habboon loo ilaalin."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data"
msgstr "4. Xulashada xogta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text1"
msgstr "Marar badan waxaad isticmaali kartaa metadata si aad u ogaato qayb macquul ah oo xog ah oo aad soo dejiso. Xitaa haddii aad ugu dambeyntii rabto inaad soo dejiso dhammaan xogta, waxay noqon kartaa mid faa'iido leh inaad mudnaanta siiso waxyaabaha ugu muhiimsan marka hore, haddii ay dhacdo in lagu ogaado oo difaacyada la hagaajiyo, ama sababtoo ah waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad iibsato diskyo badan, ama si fudud sababtoo ah wax kale ayaa noloshaada ku soo kordha ka hor intaadan soo dejisan wax walba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text2"
msgstr "Tusaale ahaan, ururinta waxay yeelan kartaa daabacado badan oo ka mid ah ilaha asalka ah (sida buug ama filim), halka midna lagu calaamadeeyay inuu yahay tayada ugu fiican. Badbaadinta daabacadahaas marka hore waxay noqon lahayd mid macquul ah. Waxaad ugu dambeyntii rabtaa inaad badbaadiso dhammaan daabacadaha, maadaama mararka qaarkood metadata laga yaabo in si khaldan loo calaamadeeyay, ama waxaa jiri kara isweydaarsi aan la garanayn oo u dhexeeya daabacadaha (tusaale ahaan, \"daabacaadda ugu fiican\" waxay noqon kartaa mid ugu fiican siyaabo badan laakiin ka sii xun siyaabo kale, sida filim leh xallinta sare laakiin aan lahayn qoraallo hoosaadyo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text3"
msgstr "Waxaad sidoo kale ka raadin kartaa xogtaada metadata si aad u hesho waxyaabo xiiso leh. Waa maxay faylka ugu weyn ee la martigeliyay, maxaase ka dhigay mid aad u weyn? Waa maxay faylka ugu yar? Ma jiraan qaabab xiiso leh ama aan la filayn marka ay timaado qaybaha qaarkood, luqadaha, iyo wixii la mid ah? Ma jiraan cinwaanno nuqul ah ama aad isugu eg? Ma jiraan qaabab marka xogta la daray, sida maalin ay faylal badan hal mar lagu daray? Waxaad inta badan wax badan ka baran kartaa adigoo eegaya xogta siyaabo kala duwan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text4"
msgstr "Kiiskeena, waxaan ka saarnay nuqulka buugaagta Z-Library ee ka dhanka ah hashyada md5 ee Library Genesis, sidaas darteed waxaan badbaadinay waqti badan oo soo dejin ah iyo meel disk ah. Tani waa xaalad aad u gaar ah si kastaba ha ahaatee. Xaaladaha badankood ma jiraan xog ururin dhamaystiran oo ku saabsan faylasha ay durba si habboon u ilaaliyeen burcad badeed kale. Tani lafteedu waa fursad weyn oo qof halkaas jooga. Waxay noqon lahayd wax weyn in la helo dulmar si joogto ah loo cusboonaysiiyo oo ku saabsan waxyaabaha sida muusikada iyo filimada oo durba si ballaaran loogu beero bogagga internetka ee torrent, sidaas darteedna ay mudnaanta hoose u leeyihiin in lagu daro muraayadaha burcad badeedka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping"
msgstr "5. Xoqidda xogta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text1"
msgstr "Hadda waxaad diyaar u tahay inaad si dhab ah u soo dejiso xogta si ballaaran. Sida hore loo sheegay, wakhtigan waxaad horeba gacanta ugu soo dejisan lahayd faylal badan, si aad si fiican u fahanto habdhaqanka iyo xayiraadaha bartilmaameedka. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, weli waxaa jiri doona waxyaabo lama filaan ah oo kuu yaal marka aad si dhab ah u soo dejiso faylal badan hal mar."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text2"
msgstr "Talooyinkayagu halkan waa inay ku sii fududaadaan. Ku bilow adigoo kaliya soo dejisanaya faylal badan. Waxaad isticmaali kartaa Python, ka dibna ku ballaari si aad u hesho dunta badan. Laakiin mararka qaarkood xitaa way fududahay in si toos ah looga abuuro faylasha Bash xogta, ka dibna la ordo dhowr ka mid ah daaqadaha terminalka badan si loo ballaariyo. Qalab farsamo oo degdeg ah oo halkan lagu xuso waa isticmaalka OUTFILE ee MySQL, kaas oo aad ku qori karto meel kasta haddii aad joojiso \"secure_file_priv\" ee mysqld.cnf (oo hubi inaad sidoo kale joojiso/ka hortagto AppArmor haddii aad ku jirto Linux)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text3"
msgstr "Waxaan xogta ku kaydinaa diskyo adag oo fudud. Ku bilow wixii aad haysato, oo si tartiib ah u ballaari. Waxay noqon kartaa mid aad u culus in laga fikiro kaydinta boqolaal TBs oo xog ah. Haddii ay taasi tahay xaaladda aad wajahayso, kaliya soo saar qayb wanaagsan marka hore, oo ku dhawaaqistaada weydiiso caawimaad si aad u kaydiso inta kale. Haddii aad rabto inaad hesho darawallo adag oo badan naftaada, markaa r/DataHoarder waxay leedahay ilo wanaagsan oo ku saabsan helitaanka heshiisyo wanaagsan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text4"
msgstr "Isku day inaadan aad uga walwalin nidaamyada faylasha quruxda badan. Way fududahay in lagu dhaco godka bakaylaha ee dejinta waxyaabaha sida ZFS. Hal faahfaahin farsamo oo la ogaanayo, si kastaba ha ahaatee, waa in nidaamyada faylasha badan aysan si fiican ula macaamilin faylal badan. Waxaan ogaanay in xal fudud uu yahay in la abuuro galal badan, tusaale ahaan, kala duwanaanshaha ID-yada kala duwan ama horudhacyada hash."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text5"
msgstr "Ka dib markaad soo dejiso xogta, hubi inaad hubiso saxnaanta faylasha adoo isticmaalaya hashyada ku jira metadata, haddii ay jiraan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution"
msgstr "6. Qaybinta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text1"
msgstr "Waxaad haysataa xogta, sidaas darteed waxaad leedahay muraayadda burcad badeedka ugu horreysa ee bartilmaameedkaaga (ugu yaraan). Si badan oo ka mid ah qaybta ugu adag ayaa dhammaatay, laakiin qaybta ugu khatarta badan ayaa weli ku horreysa. Ugu dambeyntii, ilaa hadda waxaad ahayd mid qarsoon; duulaya hoos radar. Waxaad u baahnayd oo kaliya inaad isticmaasho VPN wanaagsan inta lagu jiro, adigoon buuxin faahfaahintaada shakhsiyeed foomam kasta (duh), iyo laga yaabee inaad isticmaasho kal-fadhi browser gaar ah (ama xitaa kombuyuutar kale)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text2"
msgstr "Hadda waa inaad qaybisaa xogta. Kiiskeena waxaan marka hore rabnay inaan buugaagta ku soo celino Library Genesis, laakiin markaa si dhakhso ah ayaan u ogaanay dhibaatooyinka ku jira (sheeko vs kala soocidda aan sheekada ahayn). Sidaas darteed waxaan go'aansanay qaybinta annagoo isticmaalayna torrents qaabka Library Genesis. Haddii aad fursad u leedahay inaad ku biiriso mashruuc jira, markaa taasi waxay kuu badbaadin kartaa waqti badan. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, ma jiraan muraayadaha burcad badeedka si wanaagsan loo habeeyey oo halkaas ku yaal hadda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text3"
msgstr "Markaa aan dhahno waxaad go'aansatay inaad si toos ah u qaybiso torrents. Isku day inaad faylashaas ka dhigto kuwo yaryar, si ay ugu fududaato in lagu muraayadeeyo boggaga kale. Markaas waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad naftaada ku beerto torrents, adigoo weli qarsoon. Waxaad isticmaali kartaa VPN (leh ama aan lahayn gudbinta dekedda), ama waxaad ku bixin kartaa Bitcoins la isku daray Seedbox. Haddii aadan garanayn waxa qaar ka mid ah ereyadaas ay ka dhigan yihiin, waxaad yeelan doontaa wax badan oo akhris ah, maadaama ay muhiim tahay inaad fahanto isweydaarsiga khatarta halkan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text4"
msgstr "Waxaad ku martigelin kartaa faylasha torrent laftooda bogagga internetka ee jira. Kiiskeena, waxaan dooranay inaan si dhab ah u martigelino bog internet ah, maadaama aan sidoo kale rabnay inaan si cad u faafino falsafadeena. Waxaad tan naftaada ku samayn kartaa si la mid ah (waxaan u isticmaalnaa Njalla magacyada iyo martigelinta, oo lagu bixiyo Bitcoins la isku daray), laakiin sidoo kale xor ayaad u tahay inaad nala soo xiriirto si aan u martigelino torrents-kaaga. Waxaan raadineynaa inaan dhisno tusmo dhamaystiran oo muraayadaha burcad badeedka ah waqti ka dib, haddii fikraddan ay qabato."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text5"
msgstr "Marka la eego xulashada VPN, wax badan ayaa horey loogu qoray tan, markaa waxaan kaliya ku celin doonaa talada guud ee xulashada sumcadda. Siyaasadaha aan log-ka lahayn ee maxkamadda lagu tijaabiyay oo leh diiwaanno dheer oo ilaalinta gaarka ah waa ikhtiyaarka ugu hooseeya ee khatarta, aragtidayada. Ogow in xitaa markaad wax walba si sax ah u samayso, aadan waligaa gaari karin khatar eber ah. Tusaale ahaan, markaad beerto torrents-kaaga, wakiil qaran oo si aad ah u dhiirigeliyay ayaa laga yaabaa inuu eego socodka xogta soo galeysa iyo tan baxaysa ee server-yada VPN, oo uu ka soo saaro qofka aad tahay. Ama waxaad si fudud u khaldami kartaa si kasta. Waxaan u badan tahay inaan horey u sameynay, oo mar kale sameyn doonaa. Nasiib wanaag, dawladaha qaranku ma daneeyaan <em>in</em> badan oo ku saabsan burcad badeedka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text6"
msgstr "Go'aan la sameeyo mashruuc kasta, waa in la daabaco iyadoo la isticmaalayo aqoonsiga hore ama aan. Haddii aad sii wadato isticmaalka magacaas, markaa khaladaadka amniga hawlgalka ee mashaariicdii hore ayaa dib kuugu soo noqon kara. Laakiin daabacaadda magacyo kala duwan waxay ka dhigan tahay inaadan dhisin sumcad waarta oo dheer. Waxaan dooranay inaan ka bilowno amniga hawlgalka oo xooggan si aan u sii wadno isticmaalka aqoonsigaas, laakiin ma ka waaban doonno inaan ku daabacno magac kale haddii aan khaldanno ama haddii duruufuhu u baahdaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text7"
msgstr "Helitaanka erayga waa mid adag. Sida aan sheegnay, tani weli waa bulsho niche ah. Asal ahaan waxaan ku soo qornay Reddit, laakiin runtii waxaan ku helnay traction Hacker News. Waqtigan xaadirka ah taladayadu waa inaad ku dhejiso meelo yar oo aad aragto waxa dhacaya. Oo mar kale, nala soo xiriir. Waxaan jeclaan lahayn inaan faafino dadaallada burcad badeedka ee dheeraadka ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion"
msgstr "Gunaanad"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Waxaan rajeynaynaa in tani ay waxtar u yeelan doonto kuwa cusub ee bilaabaya kaydinta burcad-badeedda. Waxaan ku faraxsanahay inaan idinku soo dhaweyno adduunkan, markaa ha ka waaban inaad nala soo xiriirto. Aan ilaalino inta ugu badan ee aqoonta iyo dhaqanka adduunka, oo aan ku faafinno meel kasta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.title"
msgstr "Soo bandhigida Muraayadda Maktabadda Burcad-badeedda: Ilaalinta 7TB oo buugaag ah (kuwaas oo aan ku jirin Libgen)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text1"
msgstr "Mashruucan (EDIT: loo wareejiyay <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>) wuxuu ujeedadiisu tahay inuu ka qayb qaato ilaalinta iyo xoraynta aqoonta aadanaha. Waxaan sameynaa wax yar oo aan ku faano, annagoo raacaya raadkii kuwii naga horreeyay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text2"
msgstr "Diiradda mashruucan waxaa lagu muujiyay magaciisa:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.pirate"
msgstr "<strong>Burcad-badeed</strong> - Si ula kac ah ayaan u jebinnaa sharciga xuquuqda daabacaadda ee dalal badan. Tani waxay noo ogolaaneysaa inaan sameyno wax aan sharciyeysaneyn: inaan hubinno in buugaagta la faafiyo meel kasta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.library"
msgstr "<strong>Maktabad</strong> - Sida maktabadaha badankood, waxaan diiradda saareynaa agabka qoraalka sida buugaagta. Waxaa laga yaabaa inaan ballaarinno noocyada kale ee warbaahinta mustaqbalka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.mirror"
msgstr "<strong>Muraayad</strong> - Waxaan si adag u nahay muraayad maktabadaha jira. Waxaan diiradda saareynaa ilaalinta, ma ahan inaan buugaagta si sahlan loo raadiyo oo loo soo dejiyo (gelitaanka) ama inaan abuurno bulsho weyn oo dad ah oo ku biiriya buugaag cusub (ilaha)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text3"
msgstr "Maktabaddii ugu horreysay ee aan muraayad ka dhignay waa Z-Library. Tani waa maktabad caan ah (oo sharci darro ah). Waxay qaateen ururinta Library Genesis oo ay ka dhigeen mid si sahlan loo raadin karo. Intaa waxaa dheer, waxay noqdeen kuwo aad u waxtar leh oo ku dhiirrigeliya ku biirinta buugaagta cusub, iyagoo ku abaalmarinaya isticmaaleyaasha ku biiriya faa'iidooyin kala duwan. Hadda ma aysan ku biirin buugaagta cusub ee Library Genesis. Oo ka duwan Library Genesis, ma aysan ka dhigin ururintooda mid si sahlan loo muraayad ka dhigi karo, taas oo ka hortagta ilaalinta ballaaran. Tani waa muhiim u ah qaabka ganacsigooda, maadaama ay lacag ka qaadaan helitaanka ururintooda si ballaaran (in ka badan 10 buug maalintii)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text4"
msgstr "Ma sameyno xukunno akhlaaqeed oo ku saabsan lacag qaadashada si loo helo buugaag sharci darro ah oo tiro badan. Shaki kuma jiro in Z-Library ay ku guuleysatay ballaarinta helitaanka aqoonta, iyo helitaanka buugaag badan. Waxaan halkan u joognaa inaan qaybteenna ka qaadanno: hubinta in ururintan gaar loo leeyahay la ilaaliyo muddo dheer."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text5"
msgstr "Waxaan jeclaan lahayn inaan kugu martiqaadno inaad ka caawiso ilaalinta iyo xoraynta aqoonta aadanaha adigoo soo dejinaya oo abuuraya xirmooyinkayaga. Fiiri bogga mashruuca si aad u hesho macluumaad dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan sida xogta loo habeeyay."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text6"
msgstr "Waxaan sidoo kale si aad ah kuugu martiqaadeynaa inaad ku biiriso fikradahaaga ee ku saabsan ururinta xigta ee aan muraayad ka dhigi karno, iyo sida loo sameeyo. Wadajir waxaan ku gaari karnaa wax badan. Tani waa wax yar oo ka mid ah kuwa kale oo aan la soo koobi karin. Waad ku mahadsan tahay, wax kasta oo aad qabato."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.footnote"
msgstr "<em>Ma lihin xiriirinta faylasha laga bilaabo balooggan. Fadlan naftaada ka hel.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.title"
msgstr "Duminta ISBNdb, ama Immisa Buug ayaa Si Joogto ah Loo Ilaaliyaa?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.tldr"
msgstr "Haddii aan si sax ah u kala duwanaano faylasha maktabadaha hooska, boqolkiiba imisa buugaagta adduunka oo dhan ayaan ilaalinay?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text1"
msgstr "Iyadoo la adeegsanayo Muraayadda Maktabadda Burcad-badeedda (EDIT: loo wareejiyay <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>), ujeedadayadu waa inaan qaadno dhammaan buugaagta adduunka, oo aan si joogto ah u ilaalino.<sup>1</sup> Inta u dhaxaysa xirmooyinkayaga Z-Library, iyo xirmooyinkii asalka ahaa ee Library Genesis, waxaan haynaa 11,783,153 faylal. Laakiin imisa ayaa dhab ahaantii ah? Haddii aan si sax ah u kala duwanaano faylashaas, boqolkiiba imisa buugaagta adduunka oo dhan ayaan ilaalinay? Waxaan runtii jeclaan lahayn inaan helno wax sidan oo kale ah:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.10%"
msgstr "10% oee dhaxalka qoraalka ee aadanaha ayaa si joogto ah loo ilaaliyaa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text2"
msgstr "Si loo helo boqolkiiba, waxaan u baahanahay tiro guud: tirada guud ee buugaagta abid la daabacay.<sup>2</sup> Kahor intaan Google Books la baabi'in, injineer ku jira mashruuca, Leonid Taycher, <a %(booksearch_blogspot)s>wuxuu isku dayay inuu qiyaaso</a> tiradan. Wuxuu ku soo baxay — si kaftan ah — 129,864,880 (“ugu yaraan ilaa Axadda”). Wuxuu qiyaasay tiradan isagoo dhisaya xog ururin mideysan oo dhammaan buugaagta adduunka ah. Tan awgeed, wuxuu isku keenay xog ururin kala duwan ka dibna wuxuu ku midoobay siyaabo kala duwan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text3"
msgstr "Sida degdeg ah, waxaa jiray qof kale oo isku dayay inuu diiwaangeliyo dhammaan buugaagta adduunka: Aaron Swartz, oo ahaa u-doodaha dhijitaalka ah ee geeriyooday iyo aasaasaha Reddit.<sup>3</sup> Wuxuu <a %(youtube)s>bilaabay Open Library</a> isagoo leh hadaf ah “hal bog oo web ah buug kasta oo la daabacay”, isagoo isku daraya xog ka timid ilo kala duwan. Ugu dambeyntii wuxuu bixiyay qiimaha ugu dambeeya ee shaqadiisa ilaalinta dhijitaalka ah markii lagu soo oogay dacwad ku saabsan soo dejinta badan ee waraaqaha tacliinta, taasoo keentay ismiidaamintiisa. Lama huraan, tani waa mid ka mid ah sababaha kooxdeennu ay u tahay mid magac la'aan ah, iyo sababta aan u taxaddarno. Open Library waxaa weli si geesinimo leh u maamula dadka Internet Archive, iyagoo sii wada dhaxalka Aaron. Waxaan dib ugu soo laaban doonnaa tan goor dambe qoraalkan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text4"
msgstr "Qoraalka blog-ka ee Google, Taycher wuxuu sharxayaa qaar ka mid ah caqabadaha ku jira qiyaasidda tiradan. Marka hore, maxaa ka kooban buug? Waxaa jira dhowr qeexitaan oo suurtagal ah:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.copies"
msgstr "<strong>Nuqullo jireed.</strong> Dabcan tani ma aha mid aad u faa'iido leh, maadaama ay yihiin nuqullo isku mid ah. Waxay noqon lahayd wax xiiso leh haddii aan ilaalin karno dhammaan qoraallada dadka ku sameeyaan buugaagta, sida \"qoraallada dhinacyada\" ee caanka ah ee Fermat. Laakiin nasiib darro, taas waxay ahaan doontaa riyo qofka kaydiyaha ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.works"
msgstr "<strong>“Shaqooyin”.</strong> Tusaale ahaan “Harry Potter iyo Qolka Sirta” oo ah fikrad macquul ah, oo ka kooban dhammaan noocyada kala duwan, sida turjumaadaha kala duwan iyo daabacadaha. Tani waa nooc qeexitaan faa'iido leh, laakiin way adkaan kartaa in la go'aamiyo waxa la tixgelinayo. Tusaale ahaan, waxaan u badan tahay inaan dooneyno inaan ilaalino turjumaadaha kala duwan, in kastoo daabacadaha leh farqi yar aysan noqon karin kuwo muhiim ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.editions"
msgstr "<strong>“Daabacado”.</strong> Halkan waxaad tirinaysaa nooc kasta oo gaar ah oo buug ah. Haddii wax ka mid ah uu ka duwan yahay, sida daboolka ama hordhaca, waxaa loo tixgeliyaa daabacad kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.files"
msgstr "<strong>Faylasha.</strong> Markaad la shaqeyneyso maktabadaha hooska sida Library Genesis, Sci-Hub, ama Z-Library, waxaa jira tixgelin dheeraad ah. Waxaa jiri kara sawirro badan oo isla daabacaad ah. Dadkuna waxay sameyn karaan noocyo ka wanaagsan faylasha jira, iyagoo isticmaalaya OCR si ay u sawiraan qoraalka, ama saxaan bogagga si qaldan loo sawiray. Waxaan dooneynaa inaan kaliya tirino faylashaan sida hal daabacad, taas oo u baahan doonta metadata wanaagsan, ama ka saarista nuqulka iyadoo la adeegsanayo cabbirka isku ekaanshaha dukumentiga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text5"
msgstr "“Daabacado” waxay u muuqdaan qeexitaanka ugu macquulsan ee waxa “buugaag” yihiin. Si habboon, qeexitaankan waxaa sidoo kale loo isticmaalaa in lagu siiyo lambarro ISBN gaar ah. ISBN, ama Lambar Buugga Caalamiga ah ee Heerka ah, waxaa si caadi ah loogu isticmaalaa ganacsiga caalamiga ah, maadaama uu ku dhex milmay nidaamka barcode-ka caalamiga ah (”Lambarka Maqaalka Caalamiga ah”). Haddii aad rabto inaad buug ku iibiso dukaamada, waxay u baahan tahay barcode, sidaas darteed waxaad helaysaa ISBN."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text6"
msgstr "Qoraalka blog-ka ee Taycher wuxuu xusaa in inkastoo ISBN-yadu ay faa'iido leeyihiin, aysan ahayn kuwo caalami ah, maadaama ay si dhab ah loo qaatay bartamihii toddobaatameeyadii, oo aan meel kasta oo adduunka ah. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, ISBN waa aqoonsiga ugu badan ee loo isticmaalo daabacadaha buugaagta, sidaas darteed waa barta ugu fiican ee aan ka bilaabi karno. Haddii aan ka heli karno dhammaan ISBN-yada adduunka, waxaan helaynaa liis faa'iido leh oo ah buugaagta weli u baahan in la ilaaliyo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text7"
msgstr "Haddaba, xaggee ayaan ka helnaa xogta? Waxaa jira dadaallo jira oo isku dayaya inay soo ururiyaan liiska dhammaan buugaagta adduunka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.google"
msgstr "<strong>Google.</strong> Ugu dambeyntii, waxay sameeyeen cilmi-baaristan Google Books. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, metadata-kooda lama heli karo si ballaaran oo way adag tahay in la xoqo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.openlib"
msgstr "<strong>Open Library.</strong> Sida hore loo sheegay, tani waa hadafkooda oo dhan. Waxay ka soo ururiyeen tiro badan oo xog maktabadeed ah oo ka timid maktabadaha iskaashanaya iyo kaydka qaranka, waxayna sii wadaan inay sidaas sameeyaan. Waxay sidoo kale leeyihiin maktabad-yaqaanno mutadawiciin ah iyo koox farsamo oo isku dayaysa inay ka saaraan diiwaannada nuqulka ah, oo ay ku calaamadiyaan dhammaan noocyada metadata. Waxa ugu fiican, dataset-kooda waa gebi ahaanba furan. Waxaad si fudud u <a %(openlibrary)s>soo dejisan kartaa</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.worldcat"
msgstr "<strong>WorldCat.</strong> Tani waa website ay maamusho ururka aan faa'iido doonka ahayn ee OCLC, kaas oo iibiya nidaamyada maaraynta maktabadaha. Waxay ka soo ururiyaan metadata buugaagta maktabado badan, waxayna ka dhigaan mid la heli karo iyada oo loo marayo website-ka WorldCat. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, waxay sidoo kale lacag ka sameeyaan iibinta xogtan, sidaas darteed looma heli karo si ballaaran. Waxay leeyihiin qaar ka mid ah datasets ballaaran oo xaddidan oo la heli karo si loo soo dejiyo, iyada oo lala kaashanayo maktabadaha gaarka ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.isbndb"
msgstr "<strong>ISBNdb.</strong> Tani waa mawduuca qoraalkan blog-ka. ISBNdb waxay ka xoqdaa bogag kala duwan metadata buugaagta, gaar ahaan xogta qiimaha, taas oo ay markaas u iibiyaan iibiyeyaasha buugaagta, si ay u qiimeeyaan buugaagtooda iyadoo la raacayo inta kale ee suuqa. Maadaama ISBN-yadu ay hadda yihiin kuwo si weyn loo isticmaalo, waxay si wax ku ool ah u dhiseen “bog web ah buug kasta”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.ils"
msgstr "<strong>Nidaamyada maktabadaha iyo kaydka kala duwan ee shaqsiyeed.</strong> Waxaa jira maktabado iyo kayd aan la diiwaangelin oo aan la isku darin kuwa kor ku xusan, badanaa sababtoo ah ma haystaan dhaqaale ku filan, ama sababo kale awgood ma doonayaan inay xogtooda la wadaagaan Open Library, OCLC, Google, iyo wixii la mid ah. Qaar badan oo ka mid ah waxay leeyihiin diiwaanno dhijitaal ah oo laga heli karo internetka, waxayna inta badan si fiican u ilaashan yihiin, sidaas darteed haddii aad rabto inaad caawiso oo aad ku raaxaysato barashada nidaamyada maktabadaha ee yaabka leh, kuwaas waa meelo bilow wanaagsan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text8"
msgstr "Qoraalkan, waxaan ku faraxsanahay inaan ku dhawaaqno sii deyn yar (marka la barbardhigo sii deyntii hore ee Z-Library). Waxaan xoqnay inta badan ISBNdb, waxaanan ka dhignay xogta mid la heli karo si loo soo dejiyo bogga Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: loo wareejiyay <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>; halkan si toos ah uma xiriirin doonno, kaliya raadi). Kuwani waa qiyaastii 30.9 milyan oo diiwaanno ah (20GB sida <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a>; 4.4GB oo la cadaadiyay). Boggooda waxay sheeganayaan inay dhab ahaantii haystaan 32.6 milyan oo diiwaanno ah, sidaas darteed waxaa laga yaabaa inaan si uun u seegnay qaar, ama <em>iyagu</em> ay wax qaldan sameynayaan. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, hadda ma wadaagi doonno sida saxda ah ee aan u sameynay — waxaan uga tagi doonnaa sida layli akhristaha. ;-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text9"
msgstr "Waxa aan wadaagi doonno waa falanqeyn hordhac ah, si aan ugu dhawaanno qiyaasidda tirada buugaagta adduunka. Waxaan eegnay saddex datasets: dataset-kan cusub ee ISBNdb, sii deyntii hore ee metadata ee aan ka xoqnay maktabadda hooska ee Z-Library (oo ay ku jiraan Library Genesis), iyo xogta Open Library."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text10"
msgstr "Aan ku bilowno tirooyin qiyaas ah:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text11"
msgstr "Labada Z-Library/Libgen iyo Open Library waxaa ku jira buugaag badan oo ka badan ISBN-yada gaar ah. Ma waxay ka dhigan tahay in buugaag badan aysan lahayn ISBN, mise metadata ISBN ayaa si fudud u maqan? Waxaan u badan tahay inaan ka jawaabi karno su'aashan iyadoo la isku daro isbarbardhigga otomaatiga ah ee ku saleysan astaamo kale (ciwaanka, qoraaga, daabacaha, iwm), soo jiidashada ilo xog dheeraad ah, iyo soo saarista ISBN-yada sawirrada buugaagta laftooda (xaaladda Z-Library/Libgen)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text12"
msgstr "Imisa ka mid ah ISBN-yadaas ayaa gaar ah? Tani waxaa ugu wanaagsan in lagu muujiyo jaantus Venn ah:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text13"
msgstr "Si loo caddeeyo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text14"
msgstr "Waxaan la yaabnay sida yar ee is-dul-saarka ah ee jira! ISBNdb waxay leedahay tiro badan oo ISBNs ah oo aan ka muuqan midna Z-Library ama Open Library, isla markaana sidaas oo kale ayaa u jirta (inkastoo ay yar tahay laakiin weli aad u weyn) labada kale. Tani waxay keentaa su'aalo badan oo cusub. Intee in le'eg ayay caawinta is-waafajinta otomaatigga ah ka caawin lahayd calaamadaynta buugaagta aan lagu calaamadeyn ISBNs? Ma jiri doonaan is-waafajin badan oo sidaas darteed kordhin is-dul-saar? Sidoo kale, maxaa dhici lahaa haddii aan keeno dataset 4aad ama 5aad? Intee in le'eg oo is-dul-saar ah ayaan markaa arki lahayn?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text15"
msgstr "Tani waxay na siinaysaa meel bilow ah. Hadda waxaan eegi karnaa dhammaan ISBNs-ka aan ku jirin dataset-ka Z-Library, iyo kuwa aan sidoo kale ku habboonayn goobaha cinwaanka/qoraaga. Taasi waxay na siin kartaa hab lagu ilaaliyo dhammaan buugaagta adduunka: marka hore adigoo ka xoqaya internetka sawirrada, ka dibna adigoo u baxaya nolosha dhabta ah si aad u sawirto buugaagta. Tan dambe xitaa waxaa lagu maalgelin karaa dadweynaha, ama waxaa kicin kara \"abaalmarinno\" ka yimid dadka jecel inay arkaan buugaag gaar ah oo la dhijitaalaysto. Dhammaan taas waa sheeko waqti kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text16"
msgstr "Haddii aad rabto inaad ka caawiso mid ka mid ah arrimahan — falanqaynta dheeraadka ah; xoqidda metadata dheeraad ah; helitaanka buugaag dheeraad ah; OCR’ing buugaagta; samaynta tan meelaha kale (tusaale warqado, buugaag cod, filimaan, bandhigyada TV-ga, joornaalada) ama xitaa ka dhigista qaar ka mid ah xogtan mid la heli karo waxyaabaha sida ML / tababarka moodalka luqadda weyn — fadlan ila soo xiriir (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text17"
msgstr "Haddii aad si gaar ah xiisaynayso falanqaynta xogta, waxaan ka shaqaynaynaa sidii aan u heli lahayn datasets-keena iyo qoraalladayada qaab fudud oo la isticmaali karo. Waxay noqon lahayd wax weyn haddii aad si fudud u kala qaybin karto buug-yar oo aad ku bilaabi karto ciyaarista tan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text18"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, haddii aad rabto inaad taageerto shaqadan, fadlan tixgeli inaad samayso deeq. Tani waa hawl si buuxda u socota oo ay maamulaan mutadawiciin, iyo tabarucaadkaaga wuxuu sameeyaa farqi weyn. Qayb kasta way caawisaa. Waqtigan xaadirka ah waxaan qaadnaa deeqo ku jira crypto; eeg bogga Deeqda ee Kaydka Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn1"
msgstr "1. Qeexitaan macquul ah oo ah \"weligeed\". ;)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn2"
msgstr "2. Dabcan, dhaxalka qoraalka ee aadanaha waa wax ka badan buugaagta, gaar ahaan maalmahan. Sababta qoraalkan iyo sii deyntayadii ugu dambeysay waxaan diiradda saareynaa buugaagta, laakiin danahayagu way sii fidiyaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn3"
msgstr "3. Waxaa jira wax badan oo laga sheegi karo Aaron Swartz, laakiin waxaan rabnay inaan si kooban u xusno, maadaama uu door muhiim ah ka ciyaaro sheekadan. Marka waqtigu sii socdo, dad badan ayaa laga yaabaa inay magaciisa markii ugu horreysay maqlaan, kadibna ay si isdaba joog ah ugu dhex galaan godka bakaylaha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.title"
msgstr "Daaqadda muhiimka ah ee maktabadaha hooska"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.tldr"
msgstr "Sidee baan u sheegan karnaa inaan ilaalinayno ururintayada weligeed, marka ay durba ku dhowdahay 1 PB?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.links"
msgstr "<a %(critical_window_chinese)s>Nooca Shiinaha 中文版</a>, ka dood <a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.text1"
msgstr "Kaydka Anna, waxaa nalaga weydiiyaa sida aan u sheegan karno inaan ilaalinayno ururintayada weligeed, marka cabbirka guud uu durba ku dhow yahay 1 Petabyte (1000 TB), oo weli sii kordhaya. Maqaalkan waxaan ku eegi doonaa falsafaddayada, oo aan arki doonaa sababta tobanka sano ee soo socda ay muhiim ugu yihiin himiladayada ilaalinta aqoonta iyo dhaqanka aadanaha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.fig1"
msgstr "Cabbirka <a %(annas_archive_stats)s>guud</a> ee ururintayada, bilihii ugu dambeeyay, oo loo kala saaray tirada abuurayaasha torrent."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities"
msgstr "Mudnaanta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text1"
msgstr "Maxaynu ugu danaynaynaa warqadaha iyo buugaagta? Aan dhinac iska dhigno aaminsanaantayada aasaasiga ah ee ilaalinta guud ahaan — waxaan qori karnaa qoraal kale oo ku saabsan taas. Haddaba maxay yihiin warqadaha iyo buugaagta gaar ahaan? Jawaabtu waa sahlan tahay: <strong>cufnaanta macluumaadka</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text2"
msgstr "Megabyte kasta oo kaydinta ah, qoraalka qoran wuxuu kaydiyaa macluumaadka ugu badan dhammaan warbaahinta. In kasta oo aan danaynayno aqoonta iyo dhaqanka labadaba, haddana waxaan ka danaynaa kan hore. Guud ahaan, waxaan helnaa darajo cufnaanta macluumaadka iyo muhiimadda ilaalinta oo u muuqata sida tan:"

