#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.geographic"
msgstr "Xogta juqraafiyeed (tusaale ahaan, khariidado, sahanno dhulka ah)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.transcripts"
msgstr "Qoraalada dacwadaha sharci ama maxkamadeed"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.fiction"
msgstr "Noocyada sheeko-faneed ama madadaalo ee dhammaan kuwa kor ku xusan"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text3"
msgstr "Kala-sarraynta liiskan waa mid si aan kala sooc lahayn loo sameeyay — dhowr shay ayaa isku mid ah ama waxaa jira khilaafyo kooxdayada dhexdeeda — waxaana laga yaabaa inaan illoowno qaar ka mid ah qaybaha muhiimka ah. Laakiin tani waa sida aan u kala hormarino."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text4"
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah waxyaabahan aad bay uga duwan yihiin kuwa kale si aan uga walwalno (ama waxaa horey u daryeelay hay'ado kale), sida xogta dabiiciga ah ama xogta juqraafiyeed. Laakiin inta badan waxyaabaha ku jira liiskan runtii waa muhiim noo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text5"
msgstr "Qodob kale oo weyn oo ku saabsan sida aan u kala hormarino waa inta uu halis ugu jiro shaqo gaar ah. Waxaan door bidnaa inaan diirada saarno shaqooyinka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.rare"
msgstr "Naadir ah"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.underfocused"
msgstr "Si gaar ah aan diiradda loo saarin"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.at-risk"
msgstr "Si gaar ah halis ugu jira burbur (tusaale ahaan, dagaal, goynta maalgelinta, dacwado, ama cadaadis siyaasadeed)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text6"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, waxaan daneyneynaa baaxadda. Waxaan haynaa waqti iyo lacag xaddidan, sidaas darteed waxaan door bidnaa inaan bil ku bixino badbaadinta 10,000 buug halkii aan ka badbaadin lahayn 1,000 buug — haddii ay yihiin kuwo qiimo iyo halis isku mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib"
msgstr "Maktabadaha hooska"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text1"
msgstr "Waxaa jira ururo badan oo leh himilooyin la mid ah, iyo mudnaanta la mid ah. Runtii, waxaa jira maktabado, kaydad, sheybaaro, matxafyo, iyo hay'ado kale oo loo xilsaaray ilaalinta noocan ah. Badankoodna si wanaagsan ayaa loo maalgeliyay, dowlado, shakhsiyaad, ama shirkado. Laakiin waxay leeyihiin hal meel oo weyn oo indho la'aan ah: nidaamka sharciga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text2"
msgstr "Halkan waxaa ku jira doorka gaarka ah ee maktabadaha hooska, iyo sababta Kaydka Anna uu u jiro. Waxaan sameyn karnaa waxyaabo aan loo oggolaan hay'adaha kale. Hadda, ma aha (marar badan) inaan kaydin karno agab aan sharci ahayn in meel kale lagu ilaaliyo. Maya, waa sharci in meelo badan lagu dhiso kayd leh buugaag kasta, waraaqo, joornaalo, iyo wixii la mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text3"
msgstr "Laakiin waxa ay kaydadka sharciga ahi inta badan ka maqan yihiin waa <strong>ku celcelin iyo cimri dheer</strong>. Waxaa jira buugaag oo kaliya hal nuqul oo ka mid ah uu ku jiro maktabad jireed oo meel ka mid ah. Waxaa jira diiwaanno metadata ah oo ay ilaaliyaan shirkad keliya. Waxaa jira wargeysyo oo kaliya lagu keydiyo microfilm oo ku yaal kayd keliya. Maktabaduhu waxay heli karaan goyn dhaqaale, shirkaduhuna way baaba'aan karaan, kaydadkuna waa la duqayn karaa oo la gubi karaa. Tani maaha mala-awaal — tani waxay dhacdaa mar walba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text4"
msgstr "Waxa aan si gaar ah uga qaban karno Kaydka Anna waa kaydinta nuqulo badan oo shaqooyin ah, si ballaaran. Waxaan ururin karnaa waraaqo, buugaag, joornaallo, iyo wax ka badan, oo aan ku qaybin karnaa si ballaaran. Hadda waxaan tan ku samaynaa iyada oo loo marayo torrents, laakiin tignoolajiyada saxda ah maaha muhiim waxayna isbedeli doonaan waqti ka dib. Qaybta muhiimka ah waa helitaanka nuqulo badan oo lagu qaybiyo adduunka oo dhan. Qoraalkan ka yimid in ka badan 200 oo sano ka hor ayaa weli run ah:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.quote.the-lost"
msgstr "<em><q>Waxa lumay lama soo celin karo; laakiin aan badbaadino waxa haray: maaha iyada oo la adeegsanayo vaults iyo qufulo oo ka ilaalinaya indhaha dadweynaha iyo isticmaalka, iyada oo loo dhiibayo qashinka waqtiga, laakiin iyada oo la adeegsanayo nuqulo badan, oo ka dhigaya kuwo aan la gaari karin shil.</q></em><br>— Thomas Jefferson, 1791"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text5"
msgstr "Fiiro gaaban oo ku saabsan aagga dadweynaha. Maadaama Kaydka Anna uu si gaar ah diiradda u saarayo hawlaha sharci-darrada ah ee meelo badan oo adduunka ah, ma dhibsaneyno ururinta si ballaaran loo heli karo, sida buugaagta aagga dadweynaha. Hay'adaha sharciga ah ayaa inta badan si wanaagsan uga taxadira taas. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, waxaa jira tixgelinno naga dhigaya inaan mararka qaarkood ka shaqeyno ururinta si ballaaran loo heli karo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.metadata"
msgstr "Diiwaannada metadata waxaa si xor ah looga daawan karaa bogga Worldcat, laakiin looma soo dejisan karo si ballaaran (illaa aan <a %(worldcat_scrape)s>ka xoqnay</a> iyaga)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.github"
msgstr "Koodhka waxaa lagu furi karaa Github, laakiin Github guud ahaan si sahlan looma sawiri karo sidaas darteedna looma keydin karo (inkastoo kiiskan gaar ah ay jiraan nuqulo si ku filan loo qaybiyey oo ka mid ah inta badan kaydka koodhka)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.reddit"
msgstr "Reddit waa bilaash in la isticmaalo, laakiin dhawaan waxay soo rogtay tallaabooyin adag oo ka hortagaya xoqidda, iyada oo ay ugu wacan tahay tababarka LLM ee macluumaadka u baahan (wax badan oo ku saabsan taas goor dambe)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies"
msgstr "Nuqulo badan oo la sameeyo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text1"
msgstr "Dib ugu noqo su'aasheenii asalka ahayd: sidee baan u sheegan karnaa inaan si joogto ah u ilaalinno ururintayada? Dhibaatada ugu weyn halkan waa in ururintayadu ay ahayd <a %(torrents_stats)s>koraysa</a> si degdeg ah, iyada oo la xoqayo oo la furo qaar ka mid ah ururinta waaweyn (kor ku xusan shaqada cajiibka ah ee ay hore u qabteen maktabadaha hooska xogta furan sida Sci-Hub iyo Library Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text2"
msgstr "Kobocan xogta ayaa ka dhigaya mid adag in ururinta lagu sawiro adduunka oo dhan. Kaydinta xogta waa qaali! Laakiin waxaan nahay kuwo rajo leh, gaar ahaan marka aan aragno saddexdan isbeddel ee soo socda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit"
msgstr "1. Waxaan soo qaadnay miraha hoose ee la heli karo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text1"
msgstr "Tani waxay si toos ah uga soo baxdaa mudnaantayada kor ku xusan. Waxaan door bidnaa inaan marka hore ka shaqeyno xoreynta ururinta waaweyn. Hadda oo aan hubinay qaar ka mid ah ururinta ugu waaweyn adduunka, waxaan filaynaa in kobocayagu uu noqon doono mid aad u gaabis ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text2"
msgstr "Weli waxaa jira dabada dheer ee ururinta yar yar, iyo buugaag cusub ayaa la sawiraa ama la daabacaa maalin kasta, laakiin heerka ayaa u badan inuu noqdo mid aad u gaabis ah. Waxaan weli labanlaabi karnaa ama xitaa saddex jibaar karnaa cabbirka, laakiin muddo dheer."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage"
msgstr "2. Qiimaha kaydinta ayaa sii wada hoos u dhaca si xawli ah"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text1"
msgstr "Waqtiga la qorayo, <a %(diskprices)s>qiimaha diskiga</a> halkii TB waa ku dhawaad $12 oo loogu talagalay diskiga cusub, $8 oo loogu talagalay diskiga la isticmaalay, iyo $4 oo loogu talagalay cajalad. Haddii aan nahay kuwo taxadar leh oo aan eegno kaliya diskiga cusub, taasi waxay ka dhigan tahay in kaydinta petabyte ay ku kacayso ku dhawaad $12,000. Haddii aan u qaadanno in maktabaddayadu ay saddex jibaarmi doonto laga bilaabo 900TB ilaa 2.7PB, taasi waxay ka dhigan tahay $32,400 si loo sawiro maktabaddayada oo dhan. Ku darista korontada, qiimaha qalabka kale, iyo wixii la mid ah, aan u soo koobno ilaa $40,000. Ama cajalad ahaan waxay noqon doontaa $15,000–$20,000."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text2"
msgstr "Dhinac <strong>$15,000–$40,000 oo loogu talagalay dhammaan aqoonta aadanaha waa mid la xado</strong>. Dhinaca kale, waa wax yar oo adag in la filayo nuqulo buuxa oo badan, gaar ahaan haddii aan sidoo kale jeclaan lahayn in dadkaasi ay sii wadaan inay beeraan torrents-kooda si ay uga faa'iidaystaan kuwa kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text3"
msgstr "Taasi waa maanta. Laakiin horumarku wuxuu u socdaa hore:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text4"
msgstr "Qiimaha diskiga adag halkii TB ayaa si qiyaas ah loo jaray saddex meelood meel 10kii sano ee la soo dhaafay, waxayna u badan tahay inay sii wadaan inay hoos u dhacaan xawaare la mid ah. Cajaladdu waxay u muuqataa inay ku socoto waddo la mid ah. Qiimaha SSD ayaa si xawli ah u dhacaya, waxayna qaadan karaan qiimaha HDD dhamaadka tobankan sano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.hdd-prices"
msgstr "Isbeddellada qiimaha HDD ee ilo kala duwan (guji si aad u aragto daraasadda)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text5"
msgstr "Haddii tani ay sii socoto, markaa 10 sano gudahood waxaan arki karnaa kaliya $5,000–$13,000 si aan u sawirno ururintayada oo dhan (1/3), ama xitaa ka yar haddii aan ku koraan cabbir yar. In kasta oo ay weli tahay lacag badan, tani waxay noqon doontaa mid la gaari karo dad badan. Waxayna noqon kartaa mid ka sii wanaagsan sababta xigta…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density"
msgstr "3. Horumarinta cufnaanta macluumaadka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text1"
msgstr "Hadda waxaan ku kaydinnaa buugaagta qaababka asalka ah ee nala siiyo. Dabcan, waa la isku ururiyey, laakiin marar badan weli waa sawirro waaweyn ama sawirro bogag ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text2"
msgstr "Ilaa hadda, xulashooyinka kaliya ee lagu yareyn karo cabbirka guud ee ururintayada waxay ahaayeen iyada oo loo marayo isku ururin xooggan, ama dib-u-celinta. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, si loo helo kaydinta ku filan, labaduba waa kuwo aad u lumis badan dhadhankayaga. Isku ururinta culus ee sawirrada waxay ka dhigi kartaa qoraalka mid aan si fiican loo akhrisan karin. Dib-u-celintuna waxay u baahan tahay kalsooni sare oo ah in buugaagtu yihiin kuwo isku mid ah, taas oo inta badan aad u khaldan, gaar ahaan haddii nuxurka uu yahay mid isku mid ah laakiin sawirrada lagu sameeyay waqtiyo kala duwan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text3"
msgstr "Mar walba waxaa jiray ikhtiyaar saddexaad, laakiin tayadiisu waxay ahayd mid aad u liidata oo aan waligeen tixgelinay: <strong>OCR, ama Aqoonsiga Astaamaha Indhaha</strong>. Tani waa habka lagu beddelayo sawirrada qoraal cad, iyadoo la adeegsanayo AI si loo ogaado astaamaha sawirrada. Qalabka tan loogu talagalay muddo dheer ayaa jiray, waxaana ay ahaayeen kuwo aad u wanaagsan, laakiin \"aad u wanaagsan\" kuma filna ujeeddooyinka kaydinta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text4"
msgstr "Si kastaba ha ahaatee, moodooyinka barashada qoto dheer ee dhowaan la sameeyay ayaa sameeyay horumar aad u degdeg ah, in kastoo ay weli ku kacayaan kharashyo badan. Waxaan filaynaa in saxnaanta iyo kharashyada labaduba si weyn u hagaagaan sannadaha soo socda, ilaa heer ay noqon doonto mid macquul ah in lagu dabaqo maktabaddayada oo dhan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.ocr"
msgstr "Horumarinta OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text5"
msgstr "Marka taas ay dhacdo, waxaan u badan tahay inaan weli ilaalinno faylasha asalka ah, laakiin intaa waxaa dheer waxaan heli karnaa nooc aad u yar oo maktabaddayada ah oo dad badani doonayaan inay nuqul ka sameeyaan. Waxyaabaha xiisaha leh ayaa ah in qoraalka asalka ah laftiisa uu si fiican u isku ururiyo, oo ay aad u fududahay in dib loo celiyo, taasoo na siinaysa kayd badan oo dheeraad ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text6"
msgstr "Guud ahaan ma ahan mid aan macquul ahayn in la filayo ugu yaraan 5-10x yareynta cabbirka faylka guud, laga yaabee xitaa in ka badan. Xitaa iyadoo la tixgelinayo yareynta 5x, waxaan eegi doonnaa <strong>$1,000–$3,000 10 sano gudahood xitaa haddii maktabaddayadu saddex jibaaranto</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window"
msgstr "Daaqadda muhiimka ah"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text1"
msgstr "Haddii saadaashan ay sax tahay, waxaan <strong>u baahanahay oo kaliya inaan sugno dhowr sano</strong> ka hor inta aan ururintayada oo dhan si ballaaran loo nuqulayn. Sidaas darteed, ereyada Thomas Jefferson, \"waxaa la dhigay meel ka baxsan gaadhista shilalka.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text2"
msgstr "Nasiib darro, imaatinka LLMs, iyo tababarkooda macluumaadka u baahan, ayaa ka dhigay hay'adaha xuquuqda daabacaadda leh kuwo aad u difaacaya. Xitaa in ka badan sidii ay horey u ahaayeen. Goobaha internetka badan ayaa ka dhigaya mid adag in la xoqo oo la kaydiyo, dacwadaha ayaa socda, iyo dhammaan maktabadaha jireed iyo kaydadka ayaa sii wadaan in la dayaco."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text3"
msgstr "Waxaan kaliya filan karnaa in isbeddelladani sii xumaadaan, iyo in shaqooyin badan la waayo ka hor inta aysan gelin aagga dadweynaha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text4"
msgstr "<strong>Waxaan ku jirnaa xilli kacaanka kaydinta, laakiin <q>waxyaabaha lumay lama soo celin karo.</q></strong> Waxaan leenahay daaqad muhiim ah oo qiyaastii 5-10 sano ah oo ay weli aad qaali u tahay in la shaqeeyo maktabad hoos ah oo la abuuro nuqulo badan oo adduunka ah, iyo inta lagu jiro taas oo aan weli si buuxda loo xirin helitaanka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text5"
msgstr "Haddii aan ka gudbi karno daaqaddan, markaa waxaan runtii ilaalin doonnaa aqoonta iyo dhaqanka aadanaha weligeed. Waa inaanan u oggolaan in waqtigan uu khasaaro. Waa inaanan u oggolaan in daaqaddan muhiimka ah ay naga xirmato."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text6"
msgstr "Aan soconno."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.title"
msgstr "Helitaanka gaarka ah ee shirkadaha LLM ee ururinta buugaagta aan sheeko ahayn ee ugu weyn Shiinaha ee adduunka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.subtitle"
msgstr "<a %(duxiu_exclusive_chinese)s>Nooca Shiinaha 中文版</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Ka dood Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Kaydka Anna wuxuu helay ururin gaar ah oo ah 7.5 milyan / 350TB buugaag aan sheeko ahayn oo Shiine ah — ka weyn Library Genesis. Waxaan diyaar u nahay inaan siino shirkad LLM helitaan gaar ah, beddelkeedana waxaan rabnaa OCR tayo sare leh iyo soo saarista qoraalka.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text1"
msgstr "Tani waa qoraal blog gaaban. Waxaan raadinaynaa shirkad ama hay'ad naga caawisa OCR iyo soo saarista qoraalka ururin ballaaran oo aan helnay, beddelkeedana waxaan rabnaa helitaan gaar ah oo hore. Ka dib muddada xayiraadda, dabcan waxaan sii deyn doonnaa ururinta oo dhan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text2"
msgstr "Qoraallo tacliimeed oo tayo sare leh ayaa aad waxtar ugu leh tababarka LLM-yada. In kasta oo ururintayadu tahay Shiine, tani waa inay xitaa waxtar u leedahay tababarka LLM-yada Ingiriisiga: moodooyinka waxay u muuqdaan inay ku kaydiyaan fikradaha iyo aqoonta iyada oo aan loo eegin luqadda asalka ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text3"
msgstr "Tan awgeed, qoraalka waa in laga soo saaraa sawirrada. Maxay Kaydka Anna ka helaysaa? Raadinta qoraalka buuxa ee buugaagta ee isticmaaleyaasheeda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text4"
msgstr "Sababtoo ah yoolalkayagu waxay la jaanqaadayaan kuwa horumariyeyaasha LLM, waxaan raadinaynaa iskaashi. Waxaan diyaar u nahay inaan ku siino <strong>gelitaan gaar ah oo hore oo ururintan ah si ballaaran muddo 1 sano ah</strong>, haddii aad si sax ah u samayn karto OCR iyo soo saarista qoraalka. Haddii aad diyaar u tahay inaad nala wadaagto dhammaan koodhka dhuumahaaga, waxaan diyaar u nahay inaan xayirno ururinta muddo dheer."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages"
msgstr "Bogagga tusaalaha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text1"
msgstr "Si aad noogu caddeyso inaad leedahay dhuumo wanaagsan, halkan waxaa ku yaal qaar ka mid ah bogagga tusaalaha ah ee lagu bilaabayo, oo ka yimid buug ku saabsan superconductors. Dhuumahaagu waa inuu si sax ah u maareeyaa xisaabta, miisaska, jaantusyada, qoraallada hoose, iyo wixii la mid ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text2"
msgstr "U dir bogaggaaga la farsameeyay iimaylkayaga. Haddii ay u muuqdaan kuwo wanaagsan, waxaan kuu soo diri doonaa kuwo kale si gaar ah, waxaana rajeyneynaa inaad awood u yeelatid inaad si degdeg ah u socodsiiso dhuumahaaga kuwaas sidoo kale. Marka aan ku qanacno, waxaan sameyn karnaa heshiis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection"
msgstr "Ururinta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text1"
msgstr "Macluumaad dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan ururinta. <a %(duxiu)s>Duxiu</a> waa keyd weyn oo buugaag la sawiray, oo ay abuurtay <a %(chaoxing)s>SuperStar Digital Library Group</a>. Inta badan waa buugaag tacliimeed, oo la sawiray si loo heli karo si dijitaal ah jaamacadaha iyo maktabadaha. Dhageystayaashayada ku hadla Ingiriisiga, <a %(library_princeton)s>Princeton</a> iyo <a %(guides_lib_uw)s>Jaamacadda Washington</a> waxay leeyihiin dulmarro wanaagsan. Waxaa sidoo kale jira maqaal aad u wanaagsan oo bixiya asalka: <a %(doi)s>“Digitizing Chinese Books: A Case Study of the SuperStar DuXiu Scholar Search Engine”</a> (ka raadi Kaydka Anna)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text2"
msgstr "Buugaagta Duxiu ayaa muddo dheer lagu xaday internetka Shiinaha. Badanaa waxaa lagu iibinayaa wax ka yar hal doolar iibiyeyaasha. Badanaa waxaa lagu qaybiyey iyadoo la adeegsanayo wax u dhigma Google Drive ee Shiinaha, kaas oo inta badan la jabsaday si loo oggolaado meel kaydinta oo dheeraad ah. Faahfaahin farsamo oo dheeraad ah waxaa laga heli karaa <a %(github_duty_machine)s>halkan</a> iyo <a %(github_821_github_io)s>halkan</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text3"
msgstr "In kasta oo buugaagta si badh ah loo faafiyey, haddana way adag tahay in si ballaaran loo helo. Waxaan tan ku darnay liiskayaga TODO, waxaana u qoondeynay bilo badan oo shaqo waqti-buuxa ah. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, dhawaan mutadawiciin cajiib ah, yaab leh, oo karti leh ayaa nala soo xiriiray, iyagoo noo sheegay inay horey u qabteen dhammaan shaqadan — kharash weyn. Waxay nala wadaageen ururinta oo dhan, iyaga oo aan waxba ka filaynin beddelkeeda, marka laga reebo dammaanadda ilaalinta muddada-dheer. Runtii waa mid la yaab leh. Waxay oggolaadeen inay weydiistaan caawimaad sidan si loo helo ururinta OCR'ed."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text4"
msgstr "Ururintu waa 7,543,702 faylal. Tani waxay ka badan tahay Library Genesis ee aan sheeko-faneed ahayn (qiyaastii 5.3 milyan). Wadarta cabbirka faylka waa qiyaastii 359TB (326TiB) qaabkeeda hadda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text5"
msgstr "Waxaan u furan nahay soo jeedimo iyo fikrado kale. Kaliya nala soo xiriir. Fiiri Kaydka Anna si aad u hesho macluumaad dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan ururintayada, dadaallada ilaalinta, iyo sida aad uga caawin karto. Mahadsanid!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.signoff"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Digniin: qoraalkan blog-ka ah waa la joojiyay. Waxaan go'aansanay in IPFS aysan weli diyaar u ahayn waqtiga ugu fiican. Weli waxaan ku xiri doonaa faylasha IPFS laga bilaabo Kaydka Anna marka suurtagal ah, laakiin ma martigelin doonno nafteena mar dambe, mana kugula talineyno kuwa kale inay ku daydaan iyagoo adeegsanaya IPFS. Fadlan eeg boggayaga Torrents haddii aad rabto inaad ka caawiso ilaalinta ururintayada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Ka caawi abuurista Z-Library ee IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.title"
msgstr "Sida loo socodsiiyo maktabad hooska: hawlgallada Kaydka Anna"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tldr"
msgstr "Ma jiro <q>AWS oo loogu talagalay hay'adaha samafalka hooska,</q> markaa sidee baan u socodsiinnaa Kaydka Anna?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text1"
msgstr "Waxaan maamulaa <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>, mashiinka raadinta ee ugu weyn adduunka ee il furan oo aan faa'iido doon ahayn ee loogu talagalay <a %(wikipedia_shadow_library)s>maktabadaha hooska</a>, sida Sci-Hub, Library Genesis, iyo Z-Library. Ujeedadayadu waa inaan si fudud u heli karno aqoonta iyo dhaqanka, ugu dambeyntiina aan dhisno bulsho dad ah oo si wadajir ah u kaydiya oo u ilaaliya <a %(blog_isbndb_dump_how_many_books_are_preserved_forever)s>dhammaan buugaagta adduunka</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text2"
msgstr "Maqaalkan waxaan ku tusi doonaa sida aan u socodsiinno boggan, iyo caqabadaha gaarka ah ee la socda hawlgalka bog leh xaalad sharci oo shaki leh, maadaama aysan jirin \"AWS oo loogu talagalay hay'adaha samafalka hooska\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text3"
msgstr "<em>Sidoo kale eeg maqaalka walaasha ah <a %(blog_how_to_become_a_pirate_archivist)s>Sida loo noqdo kaydiyaha burcad-badeedka</a>.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens"
msgstr "Calaamadaha hal-abuurka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text1"
msgstr "Aan ku bilowno tiknoolajiyadeena. Si ula kac ah ayay u caajis badan tahay. Waxaan isticmaalnaa Flask, MariaDB, iyo ElasticSearch. Taasi waa sida ay tahay. Raadinta waa dhibaato inta badan la xaliyay, mana dooneyno inaan dib u ikhtiraacno. Intaa waxaa dheer, waa inaan ku bixinaa <a %(mcfunley)s>calaamadaha hal-abuurka</a> wax kale: inaanan la burburin xukuumadaha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text2"
msgstr "Marka, sida saxda ama sharci darrada ah ee Anna’s Archive dhab ahaantii? Tani waxay inta badan ku xiran tahay xukunka sharciga. Inta badan waddamada waxay aaminsan yihiin nooc ka mid ah xuquuqda daabacaadda, taas oo macnaheedu yahay in dadka ama shirkadaha loo qoondeeyo xukun gaar ah oo ku saabsan noocyada shaqooyinka qaarkood muddo cayiman. Si kale haddii loo dhigo, Anna’s Archive waxaan aaminsanahay in kasta oo ay jiraan faa'iidooyin, guud ahaan xuquuqda daabacaadda waa mid aan faa'iido lahayn bulshada — laakiin taasi waa sheeko kale oo waqti kale ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text3"
msgstr "Xukunka gaarka ah ee shaqooyinka qaarkood macnaheedu waa in ay sharci darro tahay in qof kasta oo ka baxsan xukunkaas uu si toos ah u qaybiyo shaqooyinkaas — annagana waxaa ku jira. Laakiin Anna’s Archive waa mashiin raadinta oo aan si toos ah u qaybinin shaqooyinkaas (ugu yaraan ma ahan boggayaga clearnet), markaa waa inaan fiicnaano, sax? Ma aha si sax ah. Meelo badan oo xukunka ah ma aha oo kaliya sharci darro in la qaybiyo shaqooyinka xuquuqda daabacaadda leh, laakiin sidoo kale in la isku xiro meelaha sidaas sameeya. Tusaale caadi ah oo tan ah waa sharciga DMCA ee Maraykanka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text4"
msgstr "Taasi waa dhamaadka ugu adag ee spectrum-ka. Dhamaadka kale ee spectrum-ka waxaa si aragti ahaan ah u jiri kara waddamo aan lahayn sharciyo xuquuqda daabacaadda ah, laakiin kuwani dhab ahaantii ma jiraan. Ku dhawaad waddan kasta wuxuu leeyahay nooc ka mid ah sharciga xuquuqda daabacaadda. Fulinta waa sheeko kale. Waxaa jira waddamo badan oo leh dowlado aan dan ka lahayn fulinta sharciga xuquuqda daabacaadda. Waxaa sidoo kale jira waddamo u dhexeeya labada xad, kuwaas oo mamnuucaya qaybinta shaqooyinka xuquuqda daabacaadda leh, laakiin aan mamnuucin isku xirka shaqooyinkaas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text5"
msgstr "Tixgelin kale waa heerka shirkadda. Haddii shirkad ay ku shaqeyso xukun aan dan ka lahayn xuquuqda daabacaadda, laakiin shirkadda lafteeda aysan diyaar u ahayn inay qaadato wax khatar ah, markaa waxay xireysaa boggaaga isla marka qof kasta ka cabanayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text6"
msgstr "Ugu dambeyntii, tixgelin weyn waa lacag bixinta. Maadaama aan u baahanahay inaan qarsoodi ahaano, ma isticmaali karno hababka lacag bixinta ee dhaqanka. Tani waxay naga tagtaa cryptocurrencies, oo kaliya qayb yar oo shirkado ah ayaa taageera kuwaas (waxaa jira kaararka deynta ee dalwaddii ah oo lagu bixiyo crypto, laakiin badanaa lama aqbalo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture"
msgstr "Qaab dhismeedka nidaamka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text1"
msgstr "Marka aan dhahno waxaad heshay shirkado diyaar u ah inay martigeliyaan boggaaga iyagoo aan ku xirin — aan ugu yeerno kuwa “bixiyeyaasha xorriyadda jecel” 😄. Waxaad si dhakhso ah u ogaan doontaa in martigelinta wax walba iyaga ay aad qaali u tahay, markaa waxaad dooneysaa inaad hesho “bixiyeyaasha jaban” oo aad halkaas ku martigeliso, adigoo u maraya bixiyeyaasha xorriyadda jecel. Haddii aad si sax ah u sameyso, bixiyeyaasha jaban marnaba ma ogaan doonaan waxa aad martigelinayso, mana heli doonaan wax cabasho ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text2"
msgstr "Iyada oo dhammaan bixiyeyaashan ay jirto khatar ah inay ku xiraan si kastaba ha ahaatee, markaa waxaad sidoo kale u baahan tahay dib u celin. Waxaan u baahan nahay tan dhammaan heerarka tiknoolajiyadeena."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text3"
msgstr "Shirkad mid yar oo xorriyadda jecel oo isku dhigtay boos xiiso leh waa Cloudflare. Waxay <a %(blog_cloudflare)s>doodaan</a> inaysan ahayn bixiye martigelin, laakiin utility, sida ISP. Sidaa darteed looma soo gudbin DMCA ama codsiyada kale ee xayiraadda, waxayna u gudbiyaan codsiyadaada bixiyahaaga martigelinta dhabta ah. Waxay u tageen ilaa maxkamad si ay u ilaaliyaan qaab-dhismeedkan. Sidaa darteed waxaan u isticmaali karnaa iyaga sidii lakab kale oo kaydinta iyo ilaalinta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text4"
msgstr "Cloudflare ma aqbasho lacag bixinta qarsoodiga ah, markaa waxaan kaliya isticmaali karnaa qorshahooda bilaashka ah. Tani waxay ka dhigan tahay inaanan isticmaali karin sifooyinkooda load balancing ama failover. Sidaa darteed waxaan <a %(annas_archive_l255)s>ku hirgelinay tan nafteena</a> heerka domain-ka. Marka boggu soo baxo, browser-ka wuxuu hubin doonaa haddii domain-ka hadda la heli karo, haddii kale, wuxuu dib u qori doonaa dhammaan URLs-ka domain kale. Maadaama Cloudflare ay kaydisaa bogag badan, tani waxay ka dhigan tahay in isticmaale uu ku degi karo domain-keena ugu weyn, xitaa haddii server-ka proxy uu hoos u dhaco, ka dibna guji xiga waxaa loo wareejin karaa domain kale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text5"
msgstr "Waxaan sidoo kale weli leenahay arrimo hawlgal caadi ah oo aan la tacaalno, sida kormeerka caafimaadka server-ka, diiwaangelinta khaladaadka backend iyo frontend, iyo wixii la mid ah. Qaab-dhismeedka failover-keena wuxuu u oggolaanayaa adkeysi dheeraad ah dhinacan sidoo kale, tusaale ahaan iyadoo la socodsiinayo set server oo gebi ahaanba kala duwan mid ka mid ah domains-ka. Waxaan xitaa ku socodsiin karnaa noocyadii hore ee koodhka iyo datasets-ka domain-kan kala duwan, haddii ay dhacdo in cilad muhiim ah oo ku jirta nooca ugu weyn aan la ogaan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text6"
msgstr "Waxaan sidoo kale ka hortagi karnaa Cloudflare oo naga soo horjeeda, iyadoo laga saaro mid ka mid ah domains-ka, sida domain-kan kala duwan. Isku-dhafyo kala duwan oo fikradahan ah ayaa suurtagal ah."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools"
msgstr "Qalabka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text1"
msgstr "Aan eegno qalabka aan u isticmaalno inaan ku dhamaystirno dhammaan tan. Tani aad ayay u kobcaysaa marka aan la kulanno dhibaatooyin cusub oo aan helno xalal cusub."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.app"
msgstr "Server-ka codsiga: Flask, MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Docker."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.proxy"
msgstr "Server-ka proxy: Varnish."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.management"
msgstr "Maareynta server-ka: Ansible, Checkmk, UFW."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.dev"
msgstr "Horumarinta: Gitlab, Weblate, Zulip."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.onion"
msgstr "Onion static hosting: Tor, Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text2"
msgstr "Waxaa jira go'aanno aan dib ugu laabanay oo aan ka fikirnay. Mid ka mid ah waa isgaarsiinta u dhaxaysa server-yada: waxaan u isticmaalnay Wireguard tan, laakiin waxaan ogaanay in mararka qaarkood ay joojiso gudbinta xogta, ama kaliya u gudbiso xogta hal jiho. Tani waxay dhacday iyadoo la isticmaalayo dhowr qaab oo Wireguard ah oo aan isku daynay, sida <a %(github_costela_wesher)s>wesher</a> iyo <a %(github_k4yt3x_wg_meshconf)s>wg-meshconf</a>. Waxaan sidoo kale isku daynay inaan tunnel ports ku sameyno SSH, annagoo isticmaalayna autossh iyo sshuttle, laakiin waxaan la kulannay <a %(github_sshuttle)s>dhibaatooyin halkaas</a> (inkastoo weli aanan hubin haddii autossh uu la kulmo dhibaatooyinka TCP-over-TCP ama maya — waxay ii muuqataa xal aan wanaagsaneyn laakiin laga yaabee inay si fiican u shaqeyso?)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text3"
msgstr "Taas beddelkeeda, waxaan ku laabanay isku xirka tooska ah ee u dhexeeya server-yada, annagoo qarinayna in server uu ku shaqeynayo bixiyeyaasha jaban annagoo isticmaalayna IP-filtering oo leh UFW. Tani waxay leedahay dhinaca hoose ee ah in Docker uusan si fiican ula shaqeyn UFW, ilaa aad isticmaasho <code>network_mode: \"host\"</code>. Dhammaan tani waa mid aad u nugul khaladaadka, sababtoo ah waxaad u soo bandhigi doontaa server-kaaga internetka adigoo leh khalad yar oo qaabeynta ah. Waxaa laga yaabaa inaan ku laabanno autossh — jawaab celin aad u soo dhaweyn leh ayaa halkan ku habboon."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text4"
msgstr "Waxaan sidoo kale dib ugu laabanay Varnish vs. Nginx. Hadda waxaan jecelnahay Varnish, laakiin waxay leedahay quirks iyo geesaha adag. Isla sidaas ayaa khuseysa Checkmk: ma jeclin, laakiin hadda way shaqeysaa. Weblate waxay ahayd mid wanaagsan laakiin aan cajiib ahayn — mararka qaarkood waxaan ka baqaa inay lumiyaan xogtayda markasta oo aan isku dayo inaan la socodsiiyo git repo-keena. Flask guud ahaan waxay ahayd mid wanaagsan, laakiin waxay leedahay quirks yaab leh oo waqti badan ku kacay si loo saxo, sida qaabeynta domains gaar ah, ama dhibaatooyinka la xiriira isku xirka SqlAlchemy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text5"
msgstr "Ilaa hadda qalabka kale waxay ahaayeen kuwo aad u wanaagsan: ma hayno cabashooyin culus oo ku saabsan MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Gitlab, Zulip, Docker, iyo Tor. Dhammaan kuwaas waxay lahaayeen dhibaatooyin, laakiin wax aan aad u culus ama waqti lumis ahayn."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions"
msgstr "Gunaanad"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text1"
msgstr "Waxay ahayd waayo-aragnimo xiiso leh in la barto sida loo dejiyo mashiin raadinta maktabad hoos ah oo adag oo adkaysi leh. Waxaa jira faahfaahin badan oo dheeraad ah oo aan la wadaagno qoraallada dambe, markaa ii sheeg waxaad jeclaan lahayd inaad wax badan ka barato!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text2"
msgstr "Sida had iyo jeer, waxaan raadineynaa deeqo si aan u taageerno shaqadan, markaa hubi inaad eegto bogga Deeqda ee Kaydka Anna. Waxaan sidoo kale raadineynaa noocyo kale oo taageero ah, sida deeqaha, kafaala-qaadayaasha muddada-dheer, bixiyeyaasha lacag-bixinta halista sare leh, laga yaabee xitaa xayaysiisyada (dhadhan leh!). Haddii aad rabto inaad ku darsato waqtigaaga iyo xirfadahaaga, waxaan had iyo jeer raadineynaa horumariyeyaal, turjubaano, iyo wixii la mid ah. Waad ku mahadsan tahay xiisahaaga iyo taageeradaada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.signature"
msgstr "- Anna iyo kooxda (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text1"
msgstr "Salaan, waxaan ahay Anna. Waxaan abuuray <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>, maktabadda hooska ugu weyn adduunka. Tani waa blog-gayga shaqsiga ah, kaas oo aniga iyo kooxdaydu ku qorno wax ku saabsan burcad-badeednimada, ilaalinta dijitaalka ah, iyo waxyaabo kale oo badan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text2"
msgstr "Ila soo xiriir <a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text3"
msgstr "Ogsoonow in website-kan uu yahay kaliya blog. Waxaan kaliya halkan ku martigelinaynaa erayadayada. Ma jiro torrents ama faylal kale oo xuquuqda daabacaadda leh oo halkan lagu martigeliyo ama lagu xiro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.heading"
msgstr "Qoraallada blog"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.title"
msgstr "1.3B WorldCat scrape"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Ku rid 5,998,794 buugag IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Digniin: qoraalkan blog-ka ah waa la joojiyay. Waxaan go'aansanay in IPFS aysan weli diyaar u ahayn waqtiga ugu fiican. Weli waxaan ku xiri doonaa faylasha IPFS laga bilaabo Kaydka Anna marka suurtagal ah, laakiin ma martigelin doonno nafteena mar dambe, mana kugula talineyno kuwa kale inay ku daydaan iyagoo adeegsanaya IPFS. Fadlan eeg boggayaga Torrents haddii aad rabto inaad ka caawiso ilaalinta ururintayada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Kaydka Anna wuxuu ka xoqay dhammaan WorldCat (ururinta metadata maktabadda ugu weyn adduunka) si uu u sameeyo liiska TODO ee buugaagta u baahan in la ilaaliyo.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "Sanad ka hor, waxaan <a %(blog)s>u dhaqaaqnay</a> inaan ka jawaabno su'aashan: <strong>Waa maxay boqolkiiba buugaagta si joogto ah loo ilaaliyay maktabadaha hooska?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Marka buug uu galo maktabad hoos ah oo xog furan sida <a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, iyo hadda <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Kaydka Anna</a>, waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa adduunka oo dhan (iyadoo loo marayo torrents), sidaas darteed si ficil ahaan ah ayaa loo ilaaliyaa weligeed."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Si aan uga jawaabno su'aasha ah boqolkiiba buugaagta la ilaaliyay, waxaan u baahanahay inaan ogaanno qaybta hoose: imisa buug ayaa guud ahaan jira? Iyo si fiican waxaan u jeclaan lahayn inaan hayno metadata dhab ah. Markaas waxaan kaliya maahan inaan la jaanqaadno maktabadaha hooska, laakiin sidoo kale <strong>samee liiska TODO ee buugaagta haray ee la ilaaliyo!</strong> Waxaan xitaa bilaabi karnaa inaan ku riyoono dadaal la wadaago si aan u hoos u dhigno liiska TODO."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "Waxaan ka soo xaaqnay <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, waxaanan soo dejinay <a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, laakiin natiijooyinku ma aysan qancin. Dhibaatada ugu weyn waxay ahayd inaysan jirin iswaafajin badan oo ISBNs ah. Eeg jaantuska Venn ee ka socda <a %(blog)s>qoraalkayaga blog-ka</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "Aad ayaan ula yaabnay sida yar ee iswaafajinta u dhexeysa ISBNdb iyo Open Library, kuwaas oo labaduba si xor ah u soo ururiya xogta ilo kala duwan, sida xaaqidda webka iyo diiwaannada maktabadaha. Haddii ay labaduba si wanaagsan u qabtaan helitaanka ISBN-yada ugu badan ee halkaas ku jira, goobohoodu hubaal waxay lahaan lahaayeen iswaafajin weyn, ama mid ayaa noqon lahaa qayb ka mid ah kan kale. Waxay nagu dhalisay su’aal, imisa buug ayaa <em>si buuxda uga baxsan goobooyinkan</em>? Waxaan u baahanahay xog-ururin weyn."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text6"
msgstr "Markaasaan u jeedsannay xog-ururinta buugta ugu weyn adduunka: <a %(wikipedia_worldcat)s>WorldCat</a>. Tani waa xog-ururin gaar ah oo ay leedahay hay’adda aan faa’iido doonka ahayn <a %(wikipedia_oclc)s>OCLC</a>, taas oo isku ururisa diiwaannada metadata ee maktabadaha adduunka oo dhan, iyagoo beddelkeed siinaya maktabadahaas helitaanka xogta buuxda, iyo inay ka muuqdaan natiijooyinka raadinta ee isticmaalayaasha ugu dambeeya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text7"
msgstr "In kasta oo OCLC ay tahay hay’ad aan faa’iido doon ahayn, habka ganacsigooda wuxuu u baahan yahay ilaalinta xogtooda. Hagaag, waan ka xunnahay inaan idhaahdo, asxaabta OCLC, waxaan siineynaa dhammaan. :-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text8"
msgstr "Sanadkii la soo dhaafay, waxaan si taxaddar leh u xaaqnay dhammaan diiwaannada WorldCat. Markii hore, waxaan helnay nasiib wanaagsan. WorldCat waxay ahayd inay soo bandhigto naqshad cusub oo dhammaystiran oo boggooda ah (Agoosto 2022). Tani waxay ku jirtay dib-u-habeyn weyn oo nidaamyadooda dambe, taas oo soo bandhigtay cillado amni oo badan. Fursadda ayaan isla markiiba ka faa’iideysanay, waxaanan awoodnay inaan xaaqno boqollaal milyan (!) oo diiwaanno ah maalmo yar gudahood."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.alt.redesign"
msgstr "<em>Dib-u-habeynta WorldCat</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text9"
msgstr "Ka dib taas, cilladaha amniga ayaa si tartiib tartiib ah loo hagaajiyay mid mid, ilaa kii ugu dambeeyay ee aan helnay la hagaajiyay ku dhawaad bil ka hor. Waqtigaas waxaan haynay ku dhawaad dhammaan diiwaannada, waxaanan u soconay kaliya diiwaanno tayo sare leh. Sidaas darteed waxaan dareemay inay tahay waqtigii la sii deyn lahaa!"

#, fuzzy
